1
00:00:10,010 --> 00:00:11,344
DAY 9
FINAL SELECTION D-1

2
00:00:11,428 --> 00:00:13,096
Only one day left
until the final selection.

3
00:00:13,179 --> 00:00:14,472
Oh, gosh.

4
00:00:17,976 --> 00:00:20,437
YOU WILL GET A "LET-IT-ALL-OUT DATE" TODAY
REQUEST ONE IF YOU WANT A FINAL SAY

5
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:21,354
It's Let-it-all-out Date.

6
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:23,148
Yeah.

7
00:00:23,231 --> 00:00:24,899
A Let-it-all-out Date…

8
00:00:26,067 --> 00:00:27,610
Let-it-all-out Date.

9
00:00:27,694 --> 00:00:29,070
- Really?
- Yeah.

10
00:00:29,821 --> 00:00:32,323
It's their last chance to talk properly

11
00:00:32,407 --> 00:00:34,200
to confess their feelings or apologize.

12
00:00:34,284 --> 00:00:37,704
So I hope they just get
everything off their chest.

13
00:00:37,787 --> 00:00:38,788
It's really the last chance.

14
00:00:38,872 --> 00:00:42,042
I won't go if I don't pick anyone
and no one picks me, right?

15
00:00:42,125 --> 00:00:44,294
- Right.
- Then, you don't get a date.

16
00:00:44,377 --> 00:00:46,463
But someone can pick you.

17
00:00:46,546 --> 00:00:47,881
Yeah, then you'll go on a date.

18
00:00:49,632 --> 00:00:52,260
<i>If Su-ji had made her decision,</i>

19
00:00:52,343 --> 00:00:54,387
whether it be a good one
or a bad one for me,

20
00:00:54,471 --> 00:00:57,015
I thought she would pick me

21
00:00:57,098 --> 00:01:00,477
to tell me her decision
on the Let-it-all-out Date.

22
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,604
Jung-yun has no other options.

23
00:01:03,313 --> 00:01:04,355
We have five minutes left.

24
00:01:07,859 --> 00:01:10,862
I requested the guaranteed
one-on-one secret date,

25
00:01:10,945 --> 00:01:13,615
so it kept feeling one-sided.

26
00:01:14,115 --> 00:01:16,993
I thought if Jeong-eun picked me
even if I didn't pick her,

27
00:01:17,077 --> 00:01:18,495
then I could really…

28
00:01:19,454 --> 00:01:22,665
I could confirm
that my feelings are reciprocated.

29
00:01:22,749 --> 00:01:24,793
<i>So I really hesitated</i>
<i>over whether to pick her or not.</i>

30
00:01:27,962 --> 00:01:31,800
<i>Yesterday, I didn't pick anyone.</i>

31
00:01:31,883 --> 00:01:35,678
<i>So I felt like I should</i>
<i>pick someone today no matter what.</i>

32
00:01:37,347 --> 00:01:40,475
<i>I didn't hesitate much</i>
<i>after I got the text.</i>

33
00:01:40,558 --> 00:01:42,018
Su-ji will probably pick Hyuk-joon.

34
00:01:42,769 --> 00:01:44,687
<i>It was an easy choice to make.</i>

35
00:01:45,772 --> 00:01:48,024
If someone picks you,
you have to go on a date?

36
00:01:48,107 --> 00:01:49,818
Yes, you have to.

37
00:01:51,110 --> 00:01:53,154
- So one person can go on several dates.
- Yeah.

38
00:01:53,238 --> 00:01:54,405
<i>She must be anxious.</i>

39
00:01:59,661 --> 00:02:01,454
Hello. Soo-hyun, do you have a minute?

40
00:02:02,038 --> 00:02:03,123
- Me?
- Can we talk for a bit?

41
00:02:03,206 --> 00:02:04,249
What's going on?

42
00:02:07,001 --> 00:02:08,503
Here. It's a letter.

43
00:02:08,586 --> 00:02:10,505
- Gosh.
- Read that later.

44
00:02:10,588 --> 00:02:13,466
And I won't be requesting a date today.

45
00:02:13,550 --> 00:02:14,926
- You won't pick anyone? Why?
- No.

46
00:02:15,009 --> 00:02:15,844
Today, I…

47
00:02:16,678 --> 00:02:19,556
I don't feel like I have anything to say.

48
00:02:20,515 --> 00:02:21,891
I wrote it all in the letter.

49
00:02:21,975 --> 00:02:23,476
- Really?
- Yeah, I wrote it all down.

50
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:25,353
- So you won't go on a date?
- No.

51
00:02:25,436 --> 00:02:26,271
Okay.

52
00:02:27,814 --> 00:02:28,857
See you later, then.

53
00:02:37,323 --> 00:02:38,700
<i>She must feel confused.</i>

54
00:02:38,783 --> 00:02:42,787
As Tae-hoon gave me the letter,
he said he wouldn't request a date.

55
00:02:46,833 --> 00:02:48,793
<i>And in his letter,</i>

56
00:02:48,877 --> 00:02:50,962
<i>he wrote that I was a charming person,</i>

57
00:02:51,045 --> 00:02:55,341
<i>but he was worried</i>
<i>that because of his lukewarm reactions,</i>

58
00:02:55,425 --> 00:02:57,844
<i>I might have been a bit hurt.</i>

59
00:02:57,927 --> 00:03:01,598
He said his feelings changed a bit, so I
wondered if that's what he was on about.

60
00:03:01,681 --> 00:03:04,934
And if I requested a date with him,

61
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:07,812
I felt like I would be
pressuring him too much,

62
00:03:07,896 --> 00:03:10,857
<i>so I felt even more conflicted.</i>

63
00:03:15,486 --> 00:03:19,449
Tae-hoon didn't request a date,
but he let it all out in a letter.

64
00:03:19,532 --> 00:03:23,286
Since Tae-hoon expressed his side,

65
00:03:23,369 --> 00:03:25,997
Soo-hyun should just
accept it to avoid more hurt.

66
00:03:26,831 --> 00:03:28,499
But I don't think Soo-hyun

67
00:03:29,167 --> 00:03:30,043
can take it in right now

68
00:03:30,126 --> 00:03:31,794
- Right.
- because she still likes him.

69
00:03:32,795 --> 00:03:34,589
The letter is one thing,

70
00:03:34,672 --> 00:03:37,091
but his decision not to request a date

71
00:03:37,175 --> 00:03:39,177
- pretty much says it all.
- Obviously.

72
00:03:39,761 --> 00:03:42,805
FINAL SELECTION D-1
THE LET-IT-ALL-OUT DATES BEGIN

73
00:03:46,392 --> 00:03:47,477
<i>Jin-woo.</i>

74
00:03:51,940 --> 00:03:54,651
<i>I didn't request</i>
<i>a Let-it-all-out Date today.</i>

75
00:03:54,734 --> 00:03:58,321
<i>But I was told I would go on a date,</i>
<i>so I hoped it was her.</i>

76
00:03:58,404 --> 00:03:59,989
<i>Did Jeong-eun perhaps pick me?</i>

77
00:04:01,032 --> 00:04:02,033
<i>Was it Jeong-eun?</i>

78
00:04:17,048 --> 00:04:20,051
- Oh my.
- It was Han-ju!

79
00:04:20,134 --> 00:04:22,929
Han-ju worked up the courage in the end.

80
00:04:23,805 --> 00:04:25,807
- You're here.
- I am.

81
00:04:27,517 --> 00:04:30,603
<i>It was Han-ju, who I talked to last night.</i>

82
00:04:33,898 --> 00:04:35,108
I wasn't disappointed.

83
00:04:35,191 --> 00:04:36,276
I had been

84
00:04:36,985 --> 00:04:39,988
kind of expecting it.

85
00:04:40,571 --> 00:04:41,572
So, rather than disappointed,

86
00:04:41,656 --> 00:04:45,576
<i>I think I was in the process of giving up.</i>

87
00:04:46,536 --> 00:04:49,205
LET-IT-ALL-OUT-DATE
HAN-JU, JIN-WOO

88
00:04:49,789 --> 00:04:51,416
I'm supposed to let it all out,

89
00:04:51,499 --> 00:04:54,585
- but we talked a lot yesterday, so…
- We did.

90
00:04:55,211 --> 00:04:58,464
<i>I picked Jin-woo without hesitation.</i>

91
00:04:59,757 --> 00:05:02,510
I'm still interested in him,

92
00:05:02,593 --> 00:05:06,514
and I was holding back
my feelings for Jin-woo until now

93
00:05:07,181 --> 00:05:10,727
because I thought he had
no romantic interest in me at all.

94
00:05:10,810 --> 00:05:12,645
So I didn't bother.

95
00:05:12,729 --> 00:05:15,857
But since he told me
that I had been on his mind,

96
00:05:16,774 --> 00:05:20,903
I decided to just express
my feelings from now on.

97
00:05:21,863 --> 00:05:25,158
- Their talk last night gave her courage.
- Yes.

98
00:05:25,742 --> 00:05:27,285
When I got back to my room last night,

99
00:05:27,368 --> 00:05:29,162
I thought, "I should have
explained myself better."

100
00:05:29,787 --> 00:05:31,539
"I was just talking nonsense."

101
00:05:31,622 --> 00:05:32,832
I felt the same way.

102
00:05:32,915 --> 00:05:34,751
I just talked without thinking.

103
00:05:34,834 --> 00:05:36,836
- I was just rambling on.
- Same.

104
00:05:36,919 --> 00:05:39,672
I went back and thought,
"I should've said this."

105
00:05:40,298 --> 00:05:42,425
- Think it through and tell me now.
- Think it through now?

106
00:05:43,801 --> 00:05:44,635
Want to go first?

107
00:05:47,847 --> 00:05:51,476
We also talked about a lot of things
while playing games last night.

108
00:05:51,559 --> 00:05:54,228
- Yeah.
- We indirectly expressed our feelings.

109
00:05:55,063 --> 00:05:58,816
And I couldn't help but notice
the faces you made during that game.

110
00:05:58,900 --> 00:06:01,360
Did I not hide my feelings well?
I was trying to.

111
00:06:01,444 --> 00:06:03,613
Your mouth was smiling,
but your eyes weren't.

112
00:06:04,530 --> 00:06:08,034
I thought I was so good
at keeping a poker face,

113
00:06:08,117 --> 00:06:08,951
but everyone knew.

114
00:06:09,035 --> 00:06:11,204
I've never seen someone look so forlorn.

115
00:06:11,788 --> 00:06:13,039
Your smile didn't reach your eyes.

116
00:06:13,122 --> 00:06:16,501
- I think she's always been on his radar.
- Yeah.

117
00:06:16,584 --> 00:06:18,461
That's why he remembers
what kind of face she made.

118
00:06:24,217 --> 00:06:25,384
Take your time.

119
00:06:26,636 --> 00:06:31,349
I couldn't tell if you were considering me
for your final selection

120
00:06:31,432 --> 00:06:33,392
or if you were just apologizing.

121
00:06:34,352 --> 00:06:35,478
It wasn't very clear.

122
00:06:35,561 --> 00:06:38,064
- Yeah, it was confusing.
- He wasn't clear.

123
00:06:38,147 --> 00:06:40,149
Well, I'm still processing it myself.

124
00:06:40,233 --> 00:06:42,860
I wonder if I'd become a bad guy

125
00:06:42,944 --> 00:06:45,488
- if I changed my mind now.
- I see.

126
00:06:47,907 --> 00:06:51,369
Before we talked yesterday,

127
00:06:51,452 --> 00:06:54,997
I wasn't going to make a final selection.

128
00:06:55,081 --> 00:06:56,791
- Right.
- The reason was…

129
00:06:57,625 --> 00:07:00,711
I mean, you and I
have similar personalities,

130
00:07:00,795 --> 00:07:05,216
and I know that
if I'm not interested in someone,

131
00:07:05,299 --> 00:07:06,884
that never changes.

132
00:07:07,468 --> 00:07:10,346
So, it felt pointless
to make an effort for a guy

133
00:07:11,139 --> 00:07:11,973
who wasn't into me.

134
00:07:12,056 --> 00:07:15,476
That's why I just kept
requesting dates with Hyuk-joon.

135
00:07:16,477 --> 00:07:19,397
And that's why I thought
about opting out of final selection.

136
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:20,648
But I got the sense

137
00:07:21,983 --> 00:07:24,527
that you might still be
considering me as an option,

138
00:07:24,610 --> 00:07:26,195
so that's got me thinking.

139
00:07:28,656 --> 00:07:31,742
I know it's a bit weird for me
to still not know my own feelings,

140
00:07:32,368 --> 00:07:33,953
but I can't help feeling a bit unsure.

141
00:07:34,036 --> 00:07:35,079
Yeah.

142
00:07:36,581 --> 00:07:37,623
I understand that.

143
00:07:38,332 --> 00:07:41,752
- I think Jin-woo feels bad and thankful.
- Yeah.

144
00:07:41,836 --> 00:07:44,255
He feels bad about turning around
and saying he likes her at this point.

145
00:07:54,474 --> 00:07:57,101
I didn't know you cried.

146
00:07:57,810 --> 00:07:59,562
Can I ask why you cried?

147
00:07:59,645 --> 00:08:01,606
It was because of my personal issues.

148
00:08:01,689 --> 00:08:03,649
It wasn't because of a specific person.

149
00:08:04,775 --> 00:08:06,736
But it did have a little to do with you.

150
00:08:07,862 --> 00:08:10,698
Because I was scared of opening up
to someone who said they liked me.

151
00:08:11,699 --> 00:08:13,201
Even though I really appreciated it.

152
00:08:15,870 --> 00:08:19,332
I'm not really used to being
on the receiving end

153
00:08:19,415 --> 00:08:20,958
of someone liking me.

154
00:08:21,042 --> 00:08:21,959
So that was confusing.

155
00:08:22,043 --> 00:08:25,087
I didn't know how
to navigate that going forward.

156
00:08:29,926 --> 00:08:30,760
Talk about TMI.

157
00:08:32,929 --> 00:08:36,390
I just didn't realize
you were such a deep-thinker.

158
00:08:37,558 --> 00:08:39,310
If only we had a little bit more time.

159
00:08:39,393 --> 00:08:41,020
- Yeah.
- That would've helped.

160
00:08:49,028 --> 00:08:49,904
What is it?

161
00:08:51,572 --> 00:08:54,909
Maybe I should have picked you
instead of Hyuk-joon for one of the dates.

162
00:08:55,409 --> 00:08:59,080
Hyuk-joon just seemed
like more of an open door.

163
00:08:59,163 --> 00:09:00,164
Well, maybe not that open.

164
00:09:00,248 --> 00:09:02,917
But he seemed willing
to get to know other people more.

165
00:09:04,252 --> 00:09:06,629
He was open to talking to other women.

166
00:09:07,505 --> 00:09:09,757
I don't know. You just seemed too…

167
00:09:10,383 --> 00:09:11,634
You just shunned everyone else.

168
00:09:12,218 --> 00:09:14,554
- I swear I didn't.
- That's how it seemed.

169
00:09:15,221 --> 00:09:16,264
What do you mean, I shunned you?

170
00:09:16,347 --> 00:09:17,765
- Well, you did.
- When?

171
00:09:17,848 --> 00:09:19,016
When did I ever?

172
00:09:21,227 --> 00:09:22,853
I swear you did.

173
00:09:27,733 --> 00:09:30,278
What does the final selection mean to you?

174
00:09:32,071 --> 00:09:34,323
I think the final selection is basically…

175
00:09:35,157 --> 00:09:37,368
I think I'll pick someone

176
00:09:37,952 --> 00:09:41,539
I want to get to know
more seriously outside the show.

177
00:09:45,042 --> 00:09:48,504
It feels like saying, "Do you want
to keep talking after the show?"

178
00:09:51,215 --> 00:09:52,925
What does it mean to you?

179
00:09:54,385 --> 00:09:55,553
I'm not sure.

180
00:09:55,636 --> 00:09:58,389
I don't know
how much weight I should put on it.

181
00:09:59,890 --> 00:10:02,310
- I guess it depends on how you see it.
- Yeah.

182
00:10:04,812 --> 00:10:06,355
You just need to follow your heart.

183
00:10:10,901 --> 00:10:14,363
At least, we get to talk like this
now that it's close to the end.

184
00:10:15,156 --> 00:10:18,868
I'm not sure how seriously
we should take the final selection,

185
00:10:19,785 --> 00:10:20,661
but…

186
00:10:21,912 --> 00:10:25,166
But I'm just going to pick you.

187
00:10:25,249 --> 00:10:26,917
So just know that.

188
00:10:29,962 --> 00:10:31,714
Unbelievable.

189
00:10:31,797 --> 00:10:32,882
She said she'll pick him.

190
00:10:32,965 --> 00:10:34,383
Han-ju is so cool.

191
00:10:34,467 --> 00:10:36,385
- Lee Han-ju!
- Gosh.

192
00:10:36,469 --> 00:10:38,638
That right there was a declaration.

193
00:10:42,266 --> 00:10:46,062
You don't need
to feel pressured or sorry at all.

194
00:10:46,646 --> 00:10:48,314
<i>She's so cool.</i>

195
00:11:01,827 --> 00:11:03,287
I can't look you in the eyes.

196
00:11:04,872 --> 00:11:05,915
You're staring into the coffee.

197
00:11:10,753 --> 00:11:12,254
How much time has passed?

198
00:11:13,172 --> 00:11:14,215
Shall we check?

199
00:11:14,298 --> 00:11:16,384
Han-ju, if you want to date Jin-woo,
cut back on the alcohol.

200
00:11:16,467 --> 00:11:18,719
Can't Jin-woo just get better
at handling his drink?

201
00:11:18,803 --> 00:11:20,596
I saw those pictures.

202
00:11:21,180 --> 00:11:22,765
<i>You're in a lot of the pictures.</i>

203
00:11:22,848 --> 00:11:25,184
STUNNING ROOMIES

204
00:11:25,851 --> 00:11:28,104
Aren't there any photos of you?

205
00:11:28,187 --> 00:11:29,814
No, I'm only in the group shots.

206
00:11:29,897 --> 00:11:31,107
I don't really like my face.

207
00:11:32,233 --> 00:11:35,694
Why not? You're the best-looking guy here.

208
00:11:35,778 --> 00:11:38,114
It's so great
how she keeps telling him that.

209
00:11:38,197 --> 00:11:40,241
- Seriously.
- It is.

210
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:43,702
If you keep blurting that out,

211
00:11:45,204 --> 00:11:46,831
you might get a lot of backlash.

212
00:11:48,332 --> 00:11:49,959
She finds him cute. That's what matters.

213
00:11:50,042 --> 00:11:51,085
- Right?
- Of course.

214
00:11:51,168 --> 00:11:52,628
Yeah, all that matters is what she thinks.

215
00:11:53,546 --> 00:11:55,798
Even before I came here,

216
00:11:55,881 --> 00:11:58,300
everyone was asking
if I got acupuncture in my head.

217
00:11:58,384 --> 00:12:00,469
<i>- A Korean medicine doctor joke.</i>
- You should have kept quiet.

218
00:12:01,137 --> 00:12:02,888
Then you could've escaped the abuse.

219
00:12:04,515 --> 00:12:06,225
Has anyone told you
that you look like a celebrity?

220
00:12:06,308 --> 00:12:08,394
Me? Is there someone who comes to mind?

221
00:12:09,603 --> 00:12:11,647
Someone just crossed my mind,
but I don't know if I should say it.

222
00:12:12,731 --> 00:12:15,067
Keep it in mind and tell me later
when we get back.

223
00:12:15,151 --> 00:12:18,070
Just write it down somewhere
so that no one finds out.

224
00:12:18,154 --> 00:12:19,947
- Go on. Say it.
- Tell her.

225
00:12:20,030 --> 00:12:22,450
You look a bit like Moon Chae-won.

226
00:12:23,075 --> 00:12:24,910
Oh… Damn it.

227
00:12:24,994 --> 00:12:26,787
I told you to write it down secretly.

228
00:12:26,871 --> 00:12:27,705
I can't go down alone.

229
00:12:28,330 --> 00:12:29,290
Yes!

230
00:12:29,373 --> 00:12:31,208
<i>- It's fine.</i>
<i>- She's blushing.</i>

231
00:12:31,292 --> 00:12:33,043
<i>I think she's even more into him now.</i>

232
00:12:34,128 --> 00:12:35,004
Let's get going.

233
00:12:36,297 --> 00:12:37,339
The weather's nice.

234
00:12:39,550 --> 00:12:41,760
I used to care about a guy's height.

235
00:12:45,639 --> 00:12:46,891
Sorry I'm a short king.

236
00:12:49,602 --> 00:12:53,063
It's fine. If you were also tall,
I would have thrown myself at you.

237
00:12:54,148 --> 00:12:55,274
I'm the only guy who's 170-something.

238
00:12:58,402 --> 00:13:01,530
I think I got my feelings across.

239
00:13:01,614 --> 00:13:05,451
I told him that I would choose him
for the final selection,

240
00:13:05,534 --> 00:13:07,244
so a weight has been lifted off my chest.

241
00:13:07,745 --> 00:13:10,748
WHAT DO YOU LIKE SO MUCH ABOUT JIN-WOO?

242
00:13:10,831 --> 00:13:13,876
His face is closest to my ideal type.

243
00:13:13,959 --> 00:13:18,631
<i>And at first, I thought he was</i>
<i>just my type looks-wise.</i>

244
00:13:19,256 --> 00:13:22,635
<i>But his personality is also my type.</i>

245
00:13:24,011 --> 00:13:24,845
He seems

246
00:13:25,638 --> 00:13:30,017
like someone who is
quite mature and thoughtful,

247
00:13:30,100 --> 00:13:32,019
and I find that really attractive.

248
00:13:32,102 --> 00:13:35,022
But I'm curious how Jin-woo feels.

249
00:13:35,105 --> 00:13:37,233
- We're curious, Jin-woo.
- I want to know too.

250
00:13:39,318 --> 00:13:41,195
Honestly, I felt a little swayed.

251
00:13:42,071 --> 00:13:47,701
Just when I started to wish
I had deeper talks with Han-ju,

252
00:13:47,785 --> 00:13:50,371
