253
00:13:50,454 --> 00:13:52,331
so my heart fluttered.

254
00:13:53,165 --> 00:13:55,042
But for me to turn around now

255
00:13:55,125 --> 00:13:58,504
and suddenly decide to be
romantically interested in Han-ju…

256
00:14:00,005 --> 00:14:01,340
It feels like

257
00:14:02,925 --> 00:14:05,386
a disrespectful thing to do to her.

258
00:14:05,469 --> 00:14:08,264
So I still feel a bit torn.

259
00:14:08,889 --> 00:14:11,225
- If only they had a bit more time.
- Yeah.

260
00:14:11,308 --> 00:14:13,269
They should talk more after the show.

261
00:14:13,352 --> 00:14:14,895
They should.

262
00:14:14,979 --> 00:14:16,522
What I think is really cool

263
00:14:16,605 --> 00:14:20,317
is that Han-ju and Jin-woo's dynamic

264
00:14:20,401 --> 00:14:23,195
resulted in Han-ju getting a bit hurt,

265
00:14:23,279 --> 00:14:25,865
but she still gave it another go
by requesting the Let-it-all-out Date

266
00:14:25,948 --> 00:14:28,617
and ended by saying
she'd pick him for the final selection.

267
00:14:28,701 --> 00:14:30,202
- Yes.
- She went that far

268
00:14:30,286 --> 00:14:32,079
despite getting hurt.

269
00:14:32,162 --> 00:14:34,373
- Exactly.
- That was really cool.

270
00:14:34,456 --> 00:14:37,084
Her vibe was different
from her dates with Hyuk-joon.

271
00:14:37,167 --> 00:14:38,335
- Totally different.
- That's right.

272
00:14:38,419 --> 00:14:40,754
And Jin-woo has started to feel a spark.

273
00:14:40,838 --> 00:14:41,881
- Yes.
- Exactly.

274
00:14:42,381 --> 00:14:45,926
He sensed how Jeong-eun felt
and was slowly giving up

275
00:14:46,010 --> 00:14:48,846
- when Han-ju confessed to him.
- Perfect timing.

276
00:14:48,929 --> 00:14:50,097
Of course, he's swayed.

277
00:14:50,180 --> 00:14:52,433
- True. He's human, after all.
- Yes.

278
00:14:57,354 --> 00:14:58,480
<i>It's Soo-hyun.</i>

279
00:15:07,823 --> 00:15:08,908
<i>White pants.</i>

280
00:15:11,869 --> 00:15:13,037
<i>Tense shoulders.</i>

281
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:13,954
<i>It's Seung-hyun.</i>

282
00:15:14,038 --> 00:15:15,497
