to go on any dates.

292
00:15:38,145 --> 00:15:39,980
So I was happy.

293
00:15:42,650 --> 00:15:44,318
- Hello.
- Hello.

294
00:15:46,111 --> 00:15:47,112
Gosh.

295
00:15:47,738 --> 00:15:48,572
Goodness.

296
00:15:53,535 --> 00:15:56,205
She's shy. The one who requests it
