297
00:15:56,288 --> 00:15:59,667
The more they learn about
their feelings, the shyer they get.

298
00:15:59,750 --> 00:16:00,709
Thank you.

299
00:16:02,544 --> 00:16:03,879
It looks so tasty.

300
00:16:07,549 --> 00:16:08,884
Listen to that sizzling.

301
00:16:08,968 --> 00:16:10,761
- I love it.
- Same.

302
00:16:12,012 --> 00:16:13,097
