303
00:16:13,180 --> 00:16:15,140
- I like them both.
- Yeah?

304
00:16:15,224 --> 00:16:17,518
- You don't have a preference? Really?
- No.

305
00:16:22,439 --> 00:16:23,649
Did you request a date today?

306
00:16:24,274 --> 00:16:25,317
- Me?
- Yeah.

307
00:16:25,401 --> 00:16:26,402
Well…

308
00:16:27,361 --> 00:16:29,571
- I told you how I felt yesterday.
- Yeah.

309
00:16:30,781 --> 00:16:32,491
But honestly,

310
00:16:32,574 --> 00:16:35,369
I was so nervous before I went in.

311
00:16:35,911 --> 00:16:37,496
I also had butterflies.

312
00:16:37,997 --> 00:16:40,833
Anyway, my interest in you right now is…

313
00:16:40,916 --> 00:16:43,168
- You're my top pick right now.
- Oh, your top pick.

314
00:16:43,752 --> 00:16:45,629
I'll give it some thought.

315
00:16:46,255 --> 00:16:47,089
- I'll have a think.
- Okay.

316
00:16:49,550 --> 00:16:51,010
And I figured

317
00:16:52,052 --> 00:16:54,054
