355
00:18:17,012 --> 00:18:19,598
But after I told you, to be honest,

356
00:18:20,224 --> 00:18:22,017
I feel kind of bad for saying this,

357
00:18:22,101 --> 00:18:24,186
but I felt much better.

358
00:18:25,104 --> 00:18:26,772
- So…
- Yeah?

359
00:18:28,315 --> 00:18:30,901
- So, for me…
- Yeah?

360
00:18:30,984 --> 00:18:34,780
I felt good about having had
that talk with you.

361
00:18:36,198 --> 00:18:38,117
What I felt when we talked yesterday

362
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:40,369
was that you must have
put so much thought into it.

363
00:18:41,078 --> 00:18:43,205
- I could feel that.
- Really?

364
00:18:43,288 --> 00:18:44,456
- I'm glad that came across.
- Yeah.

365
00:18:48,585 --> 00:18:50,963
- I thought I was done deciding.
- Really?

366
00:18:51,630 --> 00:18:52,548
Yeah.

367
00:18:52,631 --> 00:18:55,759
I felt like I had pretty much
made my mind up.

368
00:18:56,385 --> 00:18:58,846
I thought things were decided.

369
00:18:58,929 --> 00:19:01,473
But my mind changed
after the secret dates yesterday.

370
00:19:01,557 --> 00:19:02,391
Really?

371
00:19:03,142 --> 00:19:04,893
So I have a lot on my mind now.

372
00:19:05,769 --> 00:19:07,563
But I didn't feel pressured at all.

373
00:19:08,564 --> 00:19:10,774
That's good because…

374
00:19:11,358 --> 00:19:13,318
You said your mind was made up,

375
00:19:14,570 --> 00:19:15,696
but I might have…

376
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:18,991
I might have shaken things up.

377
00:19:20,159 --> 00:19:23,829
One of them should say
something a bit flirty at this point.

378
00:19:25,455 --> 00:19:26,707
You might be right.

379
00:19:31,503 --> 00:19:33,005
- You just saw that, right?
- No, I didn't.

380
00:19:34,590 --> 00:19:35,883
You might be right.

381
00:19:40,220 --> 00:19:43,265
So, has something changed for you?

382
00:19:46,018 --> 00:19:46,894
A change?

383
00:19:47,853 --> 00:19:50,397
I would be lying
if I said nothing's changed.

384
00:19:50,480 --> 00:19:51,315
Okay.

385
00:19:55,152 --> 00:19:57,738
- But my mind's just all over the place.
- You're still confused?

386
00:19:57,821 --> 00:19:59,990
In that case,
after you think things through…

387
00:20:02,451 --> 00:20:04,536
- We can talk again then.
- Yeah, that's right.

388
00:20:04,620 --> 00:20:06,330
Okay. I'll have a think.

389
00:20:06,955 --> 00:20:09,208
They're taking too long to think.

390
00:20:09,291 --> 00:20:11,460
But Soo-hyun's reaction
is a bit lukewarm, right?

391
00:20:11,543 --> 00:20:13,921
Yeah, it's not enough.
I want to see a bit more chemistry.

392
00:20:14,004 --> 00:20:15,130
- A bit more spark.
- It's lukewarm.

393
00:20:15,214 --> 00:20:16,965
- The vibe is a bit dry.
- You think so?

394
00:20:17,049 --> 00:20:19,551
- She should have said, "You shook me up."
- Yeah, that's good.

395
00:20:19,635 --> 00:20:21,595
- That would seal the deal.
- Or how about this?

396
00:20:21,678 --> 00:20:23,096
"I liked that you raised the stakes."

397
00:20:23,180 --> 00:20:24,932
- No?
- That would've been better?

398
00:20:25,599 --> 00:20:26,725
That doesn't quite work.

399
00:20:26,808 --> 00:20:28,560
- You don't think so?
- Is this a poker game?

400
00:20:29,770 --> 00:20:31,605
Hey, Eun-ji. Do you think
they're playing poker?

401
00:20:31,688 --> 00:20:34,691
"I liked that you raised the stakes
and pulled out a flush."

402
00:20:35,776 --> 00:20:36,902
So funny.

403
00:20:36,985 --> 00:20:38,654
I just wish it was a bit more exciting.

404
00:20:38,737 --> 00:20:40,030
- They need more heat.
- Raise the heat.

405
00:20:40,113 --> 00:20:41,448
- Just a bit.
- I feel like they're close.

406
00:20:41,531 --> 00:20:42,366
Just a bit more flirting.

407
00:20:42,449 --> 00:20:44,868
- Shake things up a bit.
- They can't hear us, can they?

408
00:20:44,952 --> 00:20:45,994
No, they can't.

409
00:20:46,078 --> 00:20:47,913
<i>The weather's so nice.</i>

410
00:20:47,996 --> 00:20:48,830
<i>Let's go.</i>

411
00:20:49,998 --> 00:20:51,959
- It is so nice to be by the ocean.
- Yeah.

412
00:20:52,042 --> 00:20:53,794
The view over there is really pretty.

413
00:20:53,877 --> 00:20:54,795
- You're right!
- Yeah.

414
00:20:54,878 --> 00:20:56,797
- It's really pretty over there.
- Yeah.

415
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:57,881
It's pretty anywhere you look.

416
00:20:57,965 --> 00:20:59,049
It's so stunning here.

417
00:20:59,132 --> 00:21:00,634
They look so good together.

418
00:21:00,717 --> 00:21:01,843
The color's so lovely.

419
00:21:01,927 --> 00:21:03,595
They look amazing together!

420
00:21:03,679 --> 00:21:05,847
- This place is amazing. I owe it to you.
- Yeah.

421
00:21:06,974 --> 00:21:08,684
Should I try taking a photo?

422
00:21:08,767 --> 00:21:10,477
It looks great! I want to take one too.

423
00:21:11,561 --> 00:21:13,605
- They should take one together.
- Yes, take a couple selfie!

424
00:21:13,689 --> 00:21:14,564
Come on, Soo-hyun!

425
00:21:14,648 --> 00:21:17,025
- I could stay here for a good two hours.
- Really?

426
00:21:17,526 --> 00:21:18,777
<i>How nice.</i>

427
00:21:18,860 --> 00:21:21,405
<i>- You'd think they're married from behind.</i>
<i>- Yeah.</i>

428
00:21:21,488 --> 00:21:22,781
Shall we go?

429
00:21:22,864 --> 00:21:24,992
- Shall we?
- I want to enjoy the view a bit more, but…

430
00:21:26,910 --> 00:21:28,328
Leave now so we want to come back again.

431
00:21:28,412 --> 00:21:31,415
- That's right! Clever.
- Wisdom comes with age, you know.

432
00:21:33,834 --> 00:21:34,835
Not bad.

433
00:21:34,918 --> 00:21:35,836
<i>He's doing great.</i>

434
00:21:36,336 --> 00:21:38,839
I think being brave definitely paid off.

435
00:21:38,922 --> 00:21:42,676
<i>Personally, I prefer a partner</i>
<i>I feel comfortable around,</i>

436
00:21:43,260 --> 00:21:46,513
<i>and the conversation flowed</i>
<i>really well with Soo-hyun,</i>

437
00:21:46,596 --> 00:21:48,098
<i>and I felt a connection.</i>

438
00:21:48,181 --> 00:21:51,476
And she has a really pretty smile.

439
00:21:53,186 --> 00:21:55,147
- Oh my gosh.
- Yes!

440
00:21:55,230 --> 00:21:56,356
You should have told her that.

441
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:58,358
- "You have a great smile."
- He has a great smile too.

442
00:21:58,442 --> 00:22:00,652
<i>So I felt very attracted to her.</i>

443
00:22:01,361 --> 00:22:03,405
She is my top pick right now.

444
00:22:03,488 --> 00:22:06,158
- He's really bounced back.
- This is great.

445
00:22:06,241 --> 00:22:08,577
I was able to get to know him better.

446
00:22:08,660 --> 00:22:10,412
And that was nice.

447
00:22:10,495 --> 00:22:13,415
I did feel a bit of a spark with him,

448
00:22:13,498 --> 00:22:16,376
and I do feel more interested now.

449
00:22:17,461 --> 00:22:20,756
She used her last chance for a date

450
00:22:20,839 --> 00:22:22,466
