454
00:22:27,637 --> 00:22:30,807
or Seung-hyun, who likes her?
What do you think?

455
00:22:30,891 --> 00:22:33,435
I really hope she'll pick Seung-hyun.

456
00:22:33,518 --> 00:22:35,520
But there's a chance that she…

457
00:22:35,604 --> 00:22:37,147
- Because she liked Tae-hoon a lot.
- She did.

458
00:22:37,230 --> 00:22:41,359
I'm worried she'll just go
for what she wants and pick Tae-hoon.

459
00:22:41,443 --> 00:22:43,945
I also hope she'll pick Seung-hyun,
but I'm not too sure

460
00:22:44,029 --> 00:22:47,491
