could give Tae-hoon a leg up.

461
00:22:48,533 --> 00:22:49,493
That's true.

462
00:22:55,123 --> 00:22:56,166
<i>- Who is it?</i>
<i>- Who's this?</i>

463
00:22:56,249 --> 00:22:57,292
<i>It's a great location.</i>

464
00:22:59,836 --> 00:23:01,838
<i>- Oh, it's Su-ji.</i>
<i>- It's Su-ji.</i>

465
00:23:03,215 --> 00:23:05,967
If she requested this date,
I think it will be with Hyuk-joon.

466
00:23:06,051 --> 00:23:08,011
Yeah, that's for sure.

467
00:23:14,226 --> 00:23:15,644
Hello.

468
00:23:16,269 --> 00:23:18,146
- We were right.
- A last-minute shake-up.

469
00:23:18,230 --> 00:23:19,397
A showdown.

470
00:23:20,023 --> 00:23:21,316
I feel so nervous.

471
00:23:21,399 --> 00:23:22,400
LET-IT-ALL-OUT DATE
HYUK-JOON, SU-JI

472
00:23:22,484 --> 00:23:23,401
<i>Please.</i>

473
00:23:24,486 --> 00:23:25,779
