475
00:23:27,781 --> 00:23:28,615
I see.

476
00:23:28,698 --> 00:23:29,616
LET-IT-ALL-OUT DATE
SU-JI REQUESTED THE DATE

477
00:23:29,699 --> 00:23:30,700
