478
00:23:30,784 --> 00:23:31,618
- It is.
- Yeah.

479
00:23:31,701 --> 00:23:33,537
<i>I think she'll really shake things up.</i>

480
00:23:34,454 --> 00:23:36,289
<i>I wanted to talk with Hyuk-joon</i>

481
00:23:36,373 --> 00:23:39,251
