484
00:23:44,506 --> 00:23:46,508
That's so Su-ji.

485
00:23:47,843 --> 00:23:49,469
I didn't expect to see you.

486
00:23:49,553 --> 00:23:51,513
- Really? You didn't expect it?
- No, I didn't.

487
00:23:53,473 --> 00:23:54,975
I just wanted to talk to you.

488
00:23:55,559 --> 00:23:56,601
I see.

489
00:23:57,853 --> 00:24:00,021
When we went to the theme park,

490
00:24:01,273 --> 00:24:04,442
I suddenly found it hard
to look you in the eyes.

491
00:24:04,526 --> 00:24:06,653
