- So I thought about why that was.

492
00:24:07,154 --> 00:24:11,158
At first, I tried hard to find a reason,
but I think I feel drawn to you.

493
00:24:12,242 --> 00:24:13,243
So…

494
00:24:13,326 --> 00:24:15,078
That's why I requested this date.

495
00:24:17,455 --> 00:24:18,874
I had no idea.

496
00:24:20,292 --> 00:24:22,169
- Really?
- Yeah, because you never asked

497
00:24:22,252 --> 00:24:24,796
to talk to me after that

498
00:24:24,880 --> 00:24:25,922
or you know…

499
00:24:27,048 --> 00:24:28,758
Even when we hung out alone,

500
00:24:28,842 --> 00:24:31,678
all we did was eat chocolate.

501
00:24:31,761 --> 00:24:33,847
- You seemed to really like chocolate.
- Yeah.

502
00:24:35,140 --> 00:24:38,435
Honestly, I did wonder if I should

503
00:24:38,518 --> 00:24:40,187
request a date with you yesterday.

504
00:24:41,688 --> 00:24:42,898
I ended up not doing it,

505
00:24:42,981 --> 00:24:45,192
but I kind of regretted it.

506
00:24:45,275 --> 00:24:48,445
Even though I decided
not to do it at that moment,

507
00:24:48,528 --> 00:24:50,864
I went back and forth a lot,

508
00:24:50,947 --> 00:24:54,659
so I would have regretted it less
if I had just gone through with it.

509
00:24:58,663 --> 00:24:59,539
I just…

510
00:25:00,749 --> 00:25:02,876
I decided to just go for it.

511
00:25:02,959 --> 00:25:04,920
I don't want to keep hesitating.

512
00:25:05,003 --> 00:25:07,422
She's being so direct.
Hyuk-joon's going to be confused again.

513
00:25:07,505 --> 00:25:09,507
- You can see it in his eyes already.
- Exactly.

514
00:25:09,591 --> 00:25:10,759
Oh, no.

515
00:25:10,842 --> 00:25:12,594
Have you given anyone a gift?

516
00:25:16,514 --> 00:25:18,141
Yeah, I did end up using a coupon.

517
00:25:20,810 --> 00:25:23,480
But I used it a bit late,
so I don't think he's seen it.

518
00:25:23,563 --> 00:25:25,815
Hyuk-joon got gloves as a gift.

519
00:25:25,899 --> 00:25:27,150
Hold on.

520
00:25:27,234 --> 00:25:29,069
<i>- Could it be?</i>
<i>- Were they from Su-ji?</i>

521
00:25:34,532 --> 00:25:37,035
I want to ask you what you did yesterday.

522
00:25:37,118 --> 00:25:38,495
- Yesterday--
- "Who did you meet?"

523
00:25:38,578 --> 00:25:40,664
I want to ask where you went
and what you did.

524
00:25:40,747 --> 00:25:42,749
- It's a secret.
- It is, isn't it?

525
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:45,919
I nearly told everyone too.

526
00:25:49,714 --> 00:25:51,549
<i>Hyuk-joon's growing conflicted.</i>

527
00:25:53,593 --> 00:25:56,846
Do you still feel the same way,
or have you made your mind up?

528
00:25:58,265 --> 00:26:00,183
I've made up my mind now.

529
00:26:00,267 --> 00:26:01,518
<i>He's being straightforward.</i>

530
00:26:01,601 --> 00:26:03,061
- Really?
- I've talked now

531
00:26:03,144 --> 00:26:04,521
with most of the women.

532
00:26:06,481 --> 00:26:09,067
I was concerned about
whether having shared interests

533
00:26:09,150 --> 00:26:12,153
was more important,

534
00:26:13,863 --> 00:26:15,490
or whether being drawn to someone was.

535
00:26:16,616 --> 00:26:18,743
It came down to which is more important.

536
00:26:18,827 --> 00:26:20,745
I gave it a lot of thought.

537
00:26:23,081 --> 00:26:25,125
And I'm leaning toward the person
I feel drawn to.

538
00:26:25,917 --> 00:26:27,752
I'm so curious. Can't you give me a hint?

539
00:26:28,420 --> 00:26:29,713
- About who that person is?
- Yeah.

540
00:26:31,673 --> 00:26:32,757
It's Hyun-seo.

541
00:26:34,175 --> 00:26:35,385
Wow, Hyuk-joon.

542
00:26:35,468 --> 00:26:37,637
He's being so honest. Wow.

543
00:26:39,014 --> 00:26:40,223
Yeah, Hyun-seo is my pick.

544
00:26:42,434 --> 00:26:44,144
- I saw that coming.
- From the start,

545
00:26:44,227 --> 00:26:46,271
we just kept getting

546
00:26:46,938 --> 00:26:49,316
- randomly matched on dates.
- Yeah.

547
00:26:49,399 --> 00:26:51,901
And the conversation flowed really well.

548
00:26:53,236 --> 00:26:55,030
- She stayed on your mind.
- Yeah.

549
00:26:55,572 --> 00:26:56,406
She did.

550
00:26:56,489 --> 00:26:58,325
He must feel sure of his feelings now.

551
00:26:58,408 --> 00:27:00,285
Yeah, he's stopped straying.

552
00:27:03,204 --> 00:27:06,458
It won't get awkward between us now
that I requested this date, will it?

553
00:27:06,541 --> 00:27:09,044
- Not at all.
- I hope you won't take it too seriously.

554
00:27:09,127 --> 00:27:11,171
- I won't feel pressured or anything.
- That's good.

555
00:27:11,254 --> 00:27:13,590
- Since we went to the Sparks House,
- Yeah.

556
00:27:13,673 --> 00:27:15,300
we shared the same goal.

557
00:27:15,383 --> 00:27:17,010
- We did.
- We wanted to talk to everyone.

558
00:27:17,093 --> 00:27:18,887
And this date

559
00:27:18,970 --> 00:27:22,432
is the last chance to talk one-on-one.

560
00:27:22,515 --> 00:27:23,767
- Exactly.
- It's the last chance, so…

561
00:27:23,850 --> 00:27:27,354
- We won't get another chance after this.
- That's right.

562
00:27:27,937 --> 00:27:30,648
- That's how I see it.
- I didn't want to waste this chance.

563
00:27:30,732 --> 00:27:33,193
I thought I would really regret it

564
00:27:33,276 --> 00:27:34,986
if I let another chance just slide by

565
00:27:35,070 --> 00:27:36,696
because I didn't use yesterday's chance.

566
00:27:36,780 --> 00:27:37,864
No, you didn't.

567
00:27:39,616 --> 00:27:42,744
I am a bit disappointed
since I wanted to get to know him more.

568
00:27:42,827 --> 00:27:44,913
I think if we'd had more time,

569
00:27:44,996 --> 00:27:47,207
we would've had a chance.

570
00:27:47,832 --> 00:27:50,418
But I don't have any regrets.

571
00:27:52,754 --> 00:27:54,798
<i>Su-ji has an attractive personality.</i>

572
00:27:55,924 --> 00:27:59,552
<i>And I enjoyed our conversation</i>
<i>at the Sparks House.</i>

573
00:28:00,303 --> 00:28:02,222
But she just feels like a little sister.

574
00:28:02,305 --> 00:28:04,682
I see her more like a sister
than a romantic interest.

575
00:28:04,766 --> 00:28:07,602
She's cute.

576
00:28:07,685 --> 00:28:11,481
But I think I'm more attracted
to sophisticated women.

577
00:28:11,564 --> 00:28:12,774
- He means Hyun-seo.
- Yes.

578
00:28:12,857 --> 00:28:13,942
Hyun-seo's the one for him.

579
00:28:14,025 --> 00:28:17,320
<i>He did get to know everyone</i>
<i>through all those dates.</i>

580
00:28:25,995 --> 00:28:27,372
Oh, I guess it's time to go back.

581
00:28:31,668 --> 00:28:35,213
THE LET-IT-ALL-OUT DATE IS OVER
PLEASE LEAVE THE PREMISES, SU-JI

582
00:28:35,296 --> 00:28:36,840
<i>Oh, Hyuk-joon stays?</i>

583
00:28:36,923 --> 00:28:37,799
I'll get going.

584
00:28:37,882 --> 00:28:40,510
- Hang on.
- You must have a busy day.

585
00:28:41,803 --> 00:28:42,804
That's not it.

586
00:28:42,887 --> 00:28:45,598
Don't lie. You know you do. Why play dumb?

587
00:28:45,682 --> 00:28:47,308
That's so unattractive.

588
00:28:50,562 --> 00:28:51,521
I'm glad someone said it.

589
00:28:51,604 --> 00:28:53,523
- Well done, Su-ji.
- Nice going.

590
00:28:53,606 --> 00:28:55,233
- Oh, Su-ji.
- Look at her face.

591
00:28:55,316 --> 00:28:56,401
Can you rewind?

592
00:28:56,484 --> 00:28:59,404
Don't lie. You know you do. Why play dumb?

593
00:28:59,487 --> 00:29:01,114
That's so unattractive.

594
00:29:01,698 --> 00:29:03,283
- I'm off.
- Why so harsh?

595
00:29:03,366 --> 00:29:04,451
Wow.

596
00:29:04,534 --> 00:29:05,952
I'm so glad she said that.

597
00:29:06,035 --> 00:29:09,456
I think a lot of people
will be glad she said that.

598
00:29:09,539 --> 00:29:11,249
- Hyuk-joon definitely…
- Yes?

599
00:29:11,332 --> 00:29:14,252
During his time on the show,

600
00:29:14,335 --> 00:29:16,755
he behaved quite badly
in a lot of ways, didn't he?

601
00:29:16,838 --> 00:29:18,423
- You're right.
- He was indecisive.

602
00:29:18,506 --> 00:29:19,632
He was.

603
00:29:19,716 --> 00:29:21,676
- But he's ending things on a clear note.
- He is.

604
00:29:21,760 --> 00:29:23,595
He's being very direct.

605
00:29:23,678 --> 00:29:25,513
He's on his best behavior now.

606
00:29:25,597 --> 00:29:27,849
I think Hyun-seo was also very wise.

607
00:29:27,932 --> 00:29:30,185
If she'd gone, "What the heck?
Why are you going on those dates?"

608
00:29:30,268 --> 00:29:33,396
- They might have parted ways for good.
- That's right.

609
00:29:33,480 --> 00:29:37,358
But she was like, "Go on, then.
Talk to other women."

610
00:29:37,442 --> 00:29:38,902
She was quite laid back about it.

611
00:29:38,985 --> 00:29:40,862
- Yes.
- I think that's why Hyuk-joon

612
00:29:40,945 --> 00:29:43,323
said that he's attracted
to someone sophisticated.

613
00:29:43,406 --> 00:29:44,991
I think he said that

614
00:29:45,074 --> 00:29:47,202
because he feels grateful
about how she handled it.

615
00:29:47,285 --> 00:29:50,121
- Yes.
- But Hyuk-joon really needs to know that.

616
00:29:50,622 --> 00:29:53,583
He needs to know how understanding
and considerate Hyun-seo has been.

617
00:29:53,666 --> 00:29:55,126
- Yes.
- She really likes him.

618
00:29:55,210 --> 00:29:56,586
- Yeah, he needs to know.
- He does.

619
00:29:56,669 --> 00:29:57,504
That's right.

620
00:29:57,587 --> 00:30:00,006
Hyuk-joon's arduous search for love
is finally over.

621
00:30:00,089 --> 00:30:01,424
"Arduous search for love."

622
00:30:01,508 --> 00:30:03,301
- After all that wandering…
- It was a long journey.

623
00:30:04,552 --> 00:30:06,387
I expect Hyun-seo will come next.

624
00:30:10,016 --> 00:30:11,726
- Did they cross paths? What is it?
- Is it a run-in?

625
00:30:12,435 --> 00:30:14,062
<i>- Jeong-eun?</i>
<i>- What?</i>

626
00:30:16,064 --> 00:30:18,107
She's bumped into Su-ji.

627
00:30:18,191 --> 00:30:20,443
- Fancy seeing you here.
- How crazy.

628
00:30:20,527 --> 00:30:22,487
- You must be here for the view.
- Yeah.

629
00:30:22,570 --> 00:30:26,324
- I wanted to check out whatever's here.
- It's gorgeous here, isn't it?

630
00:30:26,407 --> 00:30:27,742
I wonder what could be here.

631
00:30:27,826 --> 00:30:31,287
- There's something interesting in there.
- I thought it might be hidden.

632
00:30:31,371 --> 00:30:32,664
- See you later.
- Okay, bye!

633
00:30:32,747 --> 00:30:35,291
<i>- They're both embarrassed.</i>
<i>- Yes.</i>

634
00:30:37,544 --> 00:30:39,921
- Oh my gosh.
- Jeong-eun picked Hyuk-joon too.

635
00:30:41,005 --> 00:30:43,341
<i>- They were at the Sparks House together.</i>
<i>- That's true.</i>

636
00:30:50,557 --> 00:30:52,767
- Hey.
- Oh, hi.

637
00:30:53,852 --> 00:30:55,061
I just bumped into someone.

638
00:30:55,144 --> 00:30:56,729
LET-IT-ALL-OUT-DATE
HYUK-JOON, JEONG-EUN

639
00:30:56,813 --> 00:30:58,314
- You guys are roomies.
- That's right.

640
00:30:59,190 --> 00:31:01,526
- It's nice to see you.
- You too.

641
00:31:01,609 --> 00:31:03,862
- It's so nice and sunny here.
- Yeah.

642
00:31:05,071 --> 00:31:06,364
It's so warm.

643
00:31:09,617 --> 00:31:13,288
<i>He was someone I was still curious about.</i>

644
00:31:13,371 --> 00:31:17,208
We had said that we should talk
one-on-one some time.

645
00:31:17,292 --> 00:31:19,419
But we didn't have a chance.

646
00:31:19,502 --> 00:31:22,255
So I requested the date to make it happen.

647
00:31:24,549 --> 00:31:27,010
- Did you know I would come?
- No, I didn't.

648
00:31:29,512 --> 00:31:31,472
- Right?
- Yeah, I had no idea.

649
00:31:33,933 --> 00:31:38,313
I told you I would make a chance
to talk to you one-on-one,

650
00:31:38,396 --> 00:31:40,315
but I was never able to.

651
00:31:42,483 --> 00:31:46,029
But I like how I look today,

652
00:31:46,112 --> 00:31:49,115
so I couldn't let this chance go to waste.

653
00:31:51,576 --> 00:31:53,828
<i>Hyuk-joon's growing awkward.</i>

654
00:31:58,333 --> 00:32:00,084
It would be a shame
not to take this chance, right?

655
00:32:02,253 --> 00:32:06,674
I really appreciate you being
so honest with me

656
00:32:06,758 --> 00:32:08,635
and for requesting this date.

657
00:32:10,428 --> 00:32:12,639
But I really never imagined this.

658
00:32:15,099 --> 00:32:18,394
I thought you had your mind made up.

659
00:32:18,937 --> 00:32:21,272
You seemed to be
talking a lot with Jin-woo,

660
00:32:21,356 --> 00:32:23,900
and I noticed him being
very attentive to you.

661
00:32:23,983 --> 00:32:25,568
- Yeah.
- Right? So…

662
00:32:26,861 --> 00:32:29,572
I thought the two of you

663
00:32:30,073 --> 00:32:32,533
- had something going on.
- You thought we had something.

664
00:32:36,120 --> 00:32:38,998
But did you want to talk a bit more?

665
00:32:40,083 --> 00:32:41,834
- With who?
- Me.

666
00:32:41,918 --> 00:32:42,961
Joon, we believe in you.

667
00:32:43,044 --> 00:32:44,712
In Joon we trust!

668
00:32:45,296 --> 00:32:46,589
- I used to.
- Right.

669
00:32:48,132 --> 00:32:52,720
But when I heard that you gave
a gift to Jin-woo as well…

670
00:32:53,429 --> 00:32:56,182
I think gift-giving carries

671
00:32:56,265 --> 00:32:58,893
a big meaning to me.

672
00:33:01,980 --> 00:33:03,982
Why are you so obsessed with gifts?

673
00:33:04,065 --> 00:33:06,275
I find his gift-obsession so funny.

674
00:33:06,359 --> 00:33:08,820
- Why is he so obsessed about it?
- Seriously.

675
00:33:08,903 --> 00:33:12,156
He's admitting that gift-giving
means a bit more to him.

676
00:33:12,240 --> 00:33:13,783
It just kills me

677
00:33:13,866 --> 00:33:16,160
- how obsessed he is.
- Gift-giving means a lot to him.

678
00:33:16,244 --> 00:33:17,078
It's a huge deal.

679
00:33:17,161 --> 00:33:19,539
So I felt a bit thrown off

680
00:33:19,622 --> 00:33:23,501
when I found out you gave us both a gift.

681
00:33:24,168 --> 00:33:28,715
Rather than someone
who makes me feel confused,

682
00:33:29,882 --> 00:33:34,012
I prefer someone who is
direct and straightforward.

683
00:33:34,095 --> 00:33:37,640
And someone was very direct with me

684
00:33:37,724 --> 00:33:40,768
and honestly expressed
her feelings for me.

685
00:33:41,769 --> 00:33:44,897
So I feel more attracted to her
because of that.

686
00:33:49,193 --> 00:33:52,613
In a way, I got rejected.

687
00:33:52,697 --> 00:33:56,868
I kind of wanted to run from it,
like I did yesterday.

688
00:33:57,493 --> 00:34:00,496
But I got over that fear
and faced up to it.

689
00:34:00,580 --> 00:34:03,416
That itself was enough
to make me feel relieved.

690
00:34:04,625 --> 00:34:09,047
Su-ji and Jeong-eun's honesty
is so admirable.

691
00:34:09,130 --> 00:34:12,717
And it seems like Hyuk-joon
has really made up his mind now.

692
00:34:12,800 --> 00:34:15,303
- It's such a relief.
- It really is time for them

693
00:34:15,386 --> 00:34:17,388
- to get ready for the final selection.
- Right.

694
00:34:19,015 --> 00:34:20,850
It's Hyuk-joon. He needs to get going.

695
00:34:21,434 --> 00:34:22,310
He needs to go to her.

696
00:34:24,312 --> 00:34:25,813
Hello.

697
00:34:27,065 --> 00:34:29,567
You're here. Hello.

698
00:34:29,650 --> 00:34:31,861
- We're outdoors.
- Yeah, we're having <i>hoe</i>.

699
00:34:31,944 --> 00:34:33,404
- Finally.
- At last.

700
00:34:33,488 --> 00:34:34,322
Yeah.

701
00:34:34,405 --> 00:34:35,448
LET-IT-ALL-OUT DATE
HYUK-JOON, HYUN-SEO

702
00:34:36,032 --> 00:34:38,159
They have yellowtail. Do you want some?

703
00:34:40,661 --> 00:34:42,080
LET-IT-ALL-OUT DATE
THEY BOTH REQUESTED THE DATE

704
00:34:42,163 --> 00:34:43,998
- They both wanted it.
- That's so nice.

705
00:34:47,627 --> 00:34:49,670
- Here it comes!
- Is it here?

706
00:34:50,546 --> 00:34:51,923
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

707
00:34:52,006 --> 00:34:52,882
Wow.

708
00:34:53,508 --> 00:34:54,759
- We need a photo.
- Oh my gosh.

709
00:34:55,635 --> 00:34:57,720
- We'll have to show off later.
- We should.

710
00:34:58,304 --> 00:34:59,555
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

711
00:35:05,853 --> 00:35:07,396
- It's so good.
- So tasty.

712
00:35:08,397 --> 00:35:10,525
<i>We haven't seen Hyun-seo</i>
<i>laugh like that in a while.</i>

713
00:35:10,608 --> 00:35:12,693
What if we get too tipsy?

714
00:35:12,777 --> 00:35:14,779
- We might get all drunk.
- Exactly.

715
00:35:15,279 --> 00:35:16,489
<i>They seem at ease now.</i>

716
00:35:16,572 --> 00:35:17,698
<i>Yeah.</i>

717
00:35:20,118 --> 00:35:21,494
- Is it good?
- Yes.

718
00:35:22,078 --> 00:35:24,122
How about one of you
feed the other person?

719
00:35:24,747 --> 00:35:26,207
It tastes so good.

720
00:35:32,922 --> 00:35:34,507
It's so nice and chewy.

721
00:35:36,134 --> 00:35:37,009
This is nice.

722
00:35:37,093 --> 00:35:39,387
<i>They're finally on a proper date.</i>

723
00:35:40,638 --> 00:35:41,597
Oh, by the way,

724
00:35:42,098 --> 00:35:43,474
did you go to the Post Office?

725
00:35:43,558 --> 00:35:44,892
- When? Yesterday?
- Yeah.

726
00:35:46,227 --> 00:35:48,521
- Were the gloves from Hyun-seo?
- Maybe.

727
00:35:48,604 --> 00:35:50,148
LAST NIGHT

728
00:35:50,231 --> 00:35:51,732
CHOI HYUK-JOON

729
00:35:58,406 --> 00:36:00,158
She got me gloves.

730
00:36:00,241 --> 00:36:01,909
- He's over the moon.
- His reaction is better

731
00:36:01,993 --> 00:36:04,328
- than everyone else's.
- It makes it worth giving him a gift.

732
00:36:04,412 --> 00:36:05,705
It does.

733
00:36:05,788 --> 00:36:07,415
<i>I got gloves.</i>

734
00:36:07,498 --> 00:36:09,041
<i>It came with a letter.</i>

735
00:36:09,625 --> 00:36:10,835
<i>The tone of the letter…</i>

736
00:36:10,918 --> 00:36:11,878
KEEP YOUR HANDS WARM
THE LAST TWO DAYS

737
00:36:11,961 --> 00:36:13,087
<i>…was just so Hyun-seo.</i>

738
00:36:13,713 --> 00:36:15,214
<i>She talks in a distinct way.</i>

739
00:36:15,298 --> 00:36:17,925
<i>- Like, kind of instructional.</i>
<i>- She talks like a commander.</i>

740
00:36:18,009 --> 00:36:20,428
I think she tried
to make it really obvious.

741
00:36:20,928 --> 00:36:24,640
<i>That was probably her way</i>
<i>of directly expressing her feelings to me.</i>

742
00:36:25,266 --> 00:36:26,726
<i>I had hoped for Hyun-seo</i>

743
00:36:26,809 --> 00:36:31,772
<i>to be a little bit more expressive</i>
<i>about her feelings,</i>

744
00:36:31,856 --> 00:36:35,109
<i>and she couldn't have done it better.</i>

745
00:36:35,818 --> 00:36:37,820
<i>I was honestly really touched.</i>

746
00:36:37,904 --> 00:36:39,197
He's so over the moon.

747
00:36:39,739 --> 00:36:41,866
- We should learn from him.
- Yeah.

748
00:36:41,949 --> 00:36:43,826
When I get a gift,
I'm like, "There's no need."

749
00:36:43,910 --> 00:36:44,869
I should be like Hyuk-joon.

750
00:36:46,204 --> 00:36:47,371
- Be more excited.
- We should.

751
00:36:47,455 --> 00:36:48,748
"Oh my gosh!"

752
00:36:49,832 --> 00:36:51,459
"I've really wanted this!"

753
00:36:52,043 --> 00:36:53,920
I'm realizing that's how we should react.

754
00:36:54,003 --> 00:36:56,297
We're learning a lot from him, seriously.

755
00:36:56,380 --> 00:36:57,298
Thanks, Joon.

756
00:36:57,381 --> 00:36:58,257
- Thank you, Joon.
- Thanks.

757
00:36:58,341 --> 00:37:02,220
When I picked out the gloves,
I wasn't sure if they were a good gift.

758
00:37:02,303 --> 00:37:03,512
I was very torn.

759
00:37:04,096 --> 00:37:05,348
I really like wearing gloves.

760
00:37:05,431 --> 00:37:07,266
- Really?
- Yeah, I do.

761
00:37:07,350 --> 00:37:08,935
So I've put them on display.

762
00:37:09,644 --> 00:37:11,062
I hung up the gloves like this.

763
00:37:11,145 --> 00:37:12,647
Really? Where?

764
00:37:12,730 --> 00:37:15,566
<i>- I hung them on a clothes hanger.</i>
<i>- Really?</i>

765
00:37:15,650 --> 00:37:18,402
They're back to how it was at the start.

766
00:37:18,486 --> 00:37:19,528
He's looking at her the same.

767
00:37:20,112 --> 00:37:21,239
<i>I even took a photo.</i>

768
00:37:22,240 --> 00:37:23,741
She must find that adorable.

769
00:37:23,824 --> 00:37:26,327
He's acting less pretentious now.

770
00:37:26,410 --> 00:37:28,579
- Yeah.
- He's back to his old self.

771
00:37:28,663 --> 00:37:29,872
It was a great gift.

772
00:37:29,956 --> 00:37:32,625
I thought, "She's good at this."

773
00:37:32,708 --> 00:37:34,585
You said you weren't,
but you're good at picking gifts.

774
00:37:36,712 --> 00:37:38,506
- But I really…
- Yeah?

775
00:37:38,589 --> 00:37:40,508
I thought you were really cute yesterday.

776
00:37:40,591 --> 00:37:41,425
What do you mean?

777
00:37:41,509 --> 00:37:45,054
After we were all done hanging out
in the Post Office together,

778
00:37:45,554 --> 00:37:48,557
when you and the guys
were heading back inside,

779
00:37:48,641 --> 00:37:50,726
you were like, "Should I head back?"

780
00:37:52,395 --> 00:37:53,813
Are you going back to your room?

781
00:37:53,896 --> 00:37:55,273
I want to wash up.

782
00:37:55,898 --> 00:37:56,732
Go on in.

783
00:37:57,233 --> 00:37:58,109
Bye.

784
00:37:58,985 --> 00:38:01,028
Should I head back?

785
00:38:02,613 --> 00:38:04,073
I thought that was cute.

786
00:38:04,156 --> 00:38:05,741
You were like a puppy.

787
00:38:05,825 --> 00:38:08,327
If you think they're cute,
it means you love them.

788
00:38:08,411 --> 00:38:09,954
If you find them cute, it's game over.

789
00:38:10,037 --> 00:38:11,330
You were cute.

790
00:38:12,081 --> 00:38:14,709
I didn't want to do anything

791
00:38:14,792 --> 00:38:17,545
that could cause a misunderstanding.

792
00:38:17,628 --> 00:38:19,964
Yeah, if you had kept confusing me,

793
00:38:20,047 --> 00:38:22,133
- I wouldn't be here with you right now.
- Exactly.

794
00:38:22,216 --> 00:38:25,052
He came to his senses.
I'm so proud of him.

795
00:38:25,136 --> 00:38:28,014
If he confuses her again,
she'll have to rip his clothes to shreds.

796
00:38:28,639 --> 00:38:30,349
- After the show is over,
- Yeah?

797
00:38:30,433 --> 00:38:31,934
is there anything you want to do with me?

798
00:38:33,060 --> 00:38:33,894
Art exhibitions.

799
00:38:33,978 --> 00:38:35,396
You want to go to exhibitions?

800
00:38:35,479 --> 00:38:37,690
That means he wants
to see her outside the show.

801
00:38:37,773 --> 00:38:40,192
You mentioned that you like exhibitions.

802
00:38:40,276 --> 00:38:41,610
I enjoy things like…

803
00:38:41,694 --> 00:38:44,488
I don't talk during the exhibition,

804
00:38:44,572 --> 00:38:46,324
but after the exhibition,

805
00:38:46,407 --> 00:38:48,367
- I like going to a cafe and…
- Sharing your thoughts?

806
00:38:48,451 --> 00:38:50,328
- Yeah.
- Isn't Hyun-seo a curator?

807
00:38:50,411 --> 00:38:51,329
She is.

808
00:38:51,912 --> 00:38:54,123
We'd better take a trip
to Apgujeong sometime soon

809
00:38:54,206 --> 00:38:55,291
- together.
- Right.

810
00:38:55,374 --> 00:38:57,752
- There are a lot of galleries there.
- Yeah.

811
00:38:57,835 --> 00:38:59,587
I think it will be fun to go together.

812
00:39:00,713 --> 00:39:04,633
Since we met on Jeju Island,

813
00:39:05,343 --> 00:39:07,345
it's kind of hard

814
00:39:07,428 --> 00:39:10,264
to picture life back in Seoul.

815
00:39:11,015 --> 00:39:12,558
- I think it will feel weird.
- Yeah.

816
00:39:12,641 --> 00:39:14,143
Meeting in Seoul will be…

817
00:39:14,226 --> 00:39:16,228
<i>It will definitely feel special.</i>

818
00:39:16,312 --> 00:39:17,480
<i>- Right.</i>
- It's like we are

819
00:39:17,563 --> 00:39:19,398
stepping into a different world.

820
00:39:19,482 --> 00:39:20,399
- Yeah.
- Right?

821
00:39:20,483 --> 00:39:22,818
It's like we've been in the <i>Digimon</i> world

822
00:39:23,402 --> 00:39:24,695
and now we're back in the real world.

823
00:39:25,321 --> 00:39:27,990
- Yeah.
- They're like a couple already.

824
00:39:28,574 --> 00:39:31,118
<i>It felt like a taste</i>
<i>of how we'd be in the real world.</i>

825
00:39:31,994 --> 00:39:36,415
It was like the wall between fantasy
and reality came tumbling down.

826
00:39:36,999 --> 00:39:38,417
That wall got knocked down.

827
00:39:40,461 --> 00:39:42,671
<i>It made me go, "Oh, right.</i>
<i>We'll see each other in Seoul too."</i>

828
00:39:43,381 --> 00:39:45,883
<i>I'm looking forward to it,</i>
<i>and I feel excited.</i>

829
00:39:47,343 --> 00:39:50,054
I want to keep getting to know her
on a deeper level.

830
00:39:50,971 --> 00:39:52,348
I think it will be a lot of fun.

831
00:39:53,474 --> 00:39:57,603
<i>I'm really curious</i>
<i>what the future has in store.</i>

832
00:39:58,562 --> 00:40:02,066
But for me, rather than messaging,

833
00:40:02,149 --> 00:40:03,859
- I prefer talking on the phone.
- Really?

834
00:40:03,943 --> 00:40:05,778
And I prefer meeting up
to talking on the phone.

835
00:40:05,861 --> 00:40:09,031
- Calls make me a bit anxious.
- I know.

836
00:40:09,115 --> 00:40:10,324
Really? How do you know that?

837
00:40:10,408 --> 00:40:12,535
- You told me.
- I did not.

838
00:40:12,618 --> 00:40:13,452
- What are you--
- You…

839
00:40:14,036 --> 00:40:16,539
- You did tell me.
- No, I didn't.

840
00:40:17,373 --> 00:40:20,251
I only told Seo-yoon today
that I don't like talking on the phone.

841
00:40:20,334 --> 00:40:21,293
Really?

842
00:40:22,253 --> 00:40:23,170
Who are you…

843
00:40:24,797 --> 00:40:27,591
Who are you confusing me with?

844
00:40:27,675 --> 00:40:29,510
- Shall we toast?
- Who are you mixing me up with?

845
00:40:29,593 --> 00:40:30,970
Let's clink glasses.

846
00:40:31,053 --> 00:40:33,722
I've never told you that.

847
00:40:34,432 --> 00:40:37,017
But most people nowadays
don't like talking on the phone.

848
00:40:37,893 --> 00:40:39,395
<i>He handled that smoothly.</i>

849
00:40:39,979 --> 00:40:40,938
Jeez.

850
00:40:41,021 --> 00:40:42,398
I messed up.

851
00:40:43,065 --> 00:40:44,358
- Shall I jump into the water?
- Yeah.

852
00:40:45,943 --> 00:40:47,194
Go on. Dive in.

853
00:40:49,238 --> 00:40:51,907
It's okay. I understand.

854
00:40:51,991 --> 00:40:54,452
You've been on dates with a lot of women,

855
00:40:54,535 --> 00:40:56,745
so you must get confused
about who said what.

856
00:40:56,829 --> 00:40:58,456
Do I need to kneel down and grovel?

857
00:40:58,539 --> 00:40:59,498
Yes.

858
00:41:01,208 --> 00:41:03,294
I'm going to throw you into the water.

859
00:41:03,377 --> 00:41:04,753
There's a sting in what she said.

860
00:41:04,837 --> 00:41:06,046
She'll never let this go.

861
00:41:10,885 --> 00:41:12,344
Oh, tomorrow is the final selection.

862
00:41:12,428 --> 00:41:13,971
- Today is the last day.
- Yeah.

863
00:41:14,638 --> 00:41:17,308
Honestly, when we got the text
about the Let-it-all-out Date,

864
00:41:18,267 --> 00:41:19,810
I thought, "I have nothing to let out."

865
00:41:19,894 --> 00:41:21,520
"Who should I let it all out to?"

866
00:41:21,604 --> 00:41:23,355
I just read the first line.

867
00:41:23,439 --> 00:41:27,359
It said, "If there is someone
you want a date with…"

868
00:41:27,443 --> 00:41:29,236
And there was someone
I wanted to go on a date with.

869
00:41:29,320 --> 00:41:30,404
So you picked me?

870
00:41:30,488 --> 00:41:32,448
Of course, I did!

871
00:41:32,531 --> 00:41:33,574
Why ask the obvious?

872
00:41:35,201 --> 00:41:36,827
- Well done.
- Wait, did you not pick me?

873
00:41:38,537 --> 00:41:39,872
- I'm sorry.
- Really?

874
00:41:39,955 --> 00:41:42,041
No. Actually, I am sorry.

875
00:41:42,124 --> 00:41:42,958
Why?

876
00:41:46,378 --> 00:41:48,672
- This is such a betrayal.
- No way.

877
00:41:48,756 --> 00:41:49,924
Of course, I picked you.

878
00:41:50,508 --> 00:41:51,926
I didn't even hesitate!

879
00:41:52,009 --> 00:41:54,428
Same here! I texted straight away.

880
00:41:54,512 --> 00:41:55,596
I've never hesitated.

881
00:41:55,679 --> 00:41:57,431
I always picked you, Hyuk-joon.

882
00:41:57,515 --> 00:41:58,724
<i>There you go.</i>

883
00:41:58,807 --> 00:42:00,601
Hyun-seo went through a lot emotionally.

884
00:42:00,684 --> 00:42:01,602
That's right.

885
00:42:01,685 --> 00:42:04,772
Currently, my top pick is Hyuk-joon.

886
00:42:04,855 --> 00:42:05,814
<i>Watch how her face changes.</i>

887
00:42:05,898 --> 00:42:07,733
My top pick is Hyuk-joon.

888
00:42:07,816 --> 00:42:10,694
<i>- She was upbeat until this point.</i>
- My top pick is Hyuk-joon.

889
00:42:10,778 --> 00:42:12,738
And I don't have a second pick anymore.

890
00:42:13,864 --> 00:42:15,282
My top pick is still Hyuk-joon.

891
00:42:15,366 --> 00:42:17,159
Oh my gosh.

892
00:42:17,868 --> 00:42:18,994
<i>Her clothes got darker too.</i>

893
00:42:19,078 --> 00:42:20,329
<i>This was the toughest day.</i>

894
00:42:20,412 --> 00:42:23,332
I still pick Hyuk-joon.

895
00:42:23,415 --> 00:42:25,918
Hyuk-joon is my top pick right now.

896
00:42:26,001 --> 00:42:26,919
DO YOU HAVE A SECOND PICK?

897
00:42:27,002 --> 00:42:27,962
I don't have one.

898
00:42:29,797 --> 00:42:32,800
I would like a date with Hyuk-joon.

899
00:42:32,883 --> 00:42:34,802
- She's been so consistent.
- She has.

900
00:42:34,885 --> 00:42:36,345
It's always been Hyuk-joon.

901
00:42:38,639 --> 00:42:39,723
Gosh. Look at the sunset.

902
00:42:41,267 --> 00:42:43,310
Wow, it's beautiful.

903
00:42:46,188 --> 00:42:48,440
<i>They look like a real couple too.</i>

904
00:42:48,524 --> 00:42:49,942
<i>- They look good.</i>
<i>- Look how they're standing.</i>

905
00:42:51,151 --> 00:42:51,986
I'll take a photo of you.

906
00:42:53,028 --> 00:42:54,154
It's like a scene from a K-drama.

907
00:42:55,072 --> 00:42:56,282
Do you trust me?

908
00:42:56,365 --> 00:42:59,660
Make me look like a model, okay?

909
00:43:03,956 --> 00:43:06,333
- Goodness.
- Yes! They're taking one together.

910
00:43:06,417 --> 00:43:07,835
One, two, three.

911
00:43:07,918 --> 00:43:09,503
<i>It's their first couple photo.</i>

912
00:43:09,587 --> 00:43:10,421
<i>Yes.</i>

913
00:43:12,715 --> 00:43:14,592
We got to capture the moment.

914
00:43:15,676 --> 00:43:16,844
Talk about romantic.

915
00:43:16,927 --> 00:43:19,013
Wow, what a stunning background.

916
00:43:22,349 --> 00:43:24,310
<i>- Wow, this is…</i>
<i>- It's like a painting.</i>

917
00:43:26,270 --> 00:43:27,563
Should we head down?

918
00:43:27,646 --> 00:43:29,481
- Let's go.
- Watch your step.

919
00:43:30,232 --> 00:43:31,066
Thank you.

920
00:43:33,944 --> 00:43:34,820
Look at that.

921
00:43:34,903 --> 00:43:36,155
Jeez, look at that.

922
00:43:36,238 --> 00:43:37,573
They held hands!

923
00:43:37,656 --> 00:43:39,158
They didn't grab the wrist or anything.

924
00:43:39,783 --> 00:43:40,826
- Gosh.
- Can you make it down?

925
00:43:41,452 --> 00:43:42,494
Be careful.

926
00:43:43,162 --> 00:43:44,997
- Why let go?
- Grab it again.

927
00:43:45,080 --> 00:43:47,416
Hold hands again while you walk.

928
00:43:50,044 --> 00:43:52,046
I feel like I'm blushing even now.

929
00:43:53,005 --> 00:43:55,299
<i>The stairs were a bit steep,</i>
<i>so when we walked down,</i>

930
00:43:55,382 --> 00:43:57,134
<i>I helped her out a bit.</i>

931
00:43:58,636 --> 00:44:00,721
<i>I felt butterflies.</i>

932
00:44:02,431 --> 00:44:06,226
But then, I immediately looked away.

933
00:44:06,310 --> 00:44:07,645
<i>Because he felt awkward?</i>

934
00:44:07,728 --> 00:44:11,231
<i>I felt too shy to look at her for a while.</i>

935
00:44:12,524 --> 00:44:14,610
His hand was very soft.

936
00:44:14,693 --> 00:44:15,778
It felt a bit…

937
00:44:17,738 --> 00:44:18,781
It felt electric.

938
00:44:20,532 --> 00:44:22,743
<i>Of all the dates I've been on,</i>

939
00:44:22,826 --> 00:44:25,746
<i>it was the most memorable moment.</i>

940
00:44:25,829 --> 00:44:28,207
What a meaningful date.

941
00:44:28,290 --> 00:44:30,918
This date for Hyun-seo and Hyuk-joon was…

942
00:44:31,001 --> 00:44:33,712
- It's washed away all my anger.
- Yes.

943
00:44:33,796 --> 00:44:37,508
Isn't it the first time anyone's
held hands since the partner dancing?

944
00:44:37,591 --> 00:44:39,009
- That's right.
- It's the first time.

945
00:44:39,093 --> 00:44:40,552
Oh my gosh.

946
00:44:40,636 --> 00:44:43,847
- Gifts mean more to Hyuk-joon than most.
- That's right.

947
00:44:43,931 --> 00:44:47,393
And he confirmed the gloves
were from Hyun-seo.

948
00:44:47,476 --> 00:44:48,310
- It's perfect.
- Yes.

949
00:44:48,394 --> 00:44:50,479
They're a done deal, right?

950
00:44:50,562 --> 00:44:52,231
- Of course.
- Absolutely.

951
00:44:53,982 --> 00:44:55,359
<i>Lovely weather.</i>

952
00:44:56,360 --> 00:44:58,654
Ring his doorbell. I'll wait with you.

953
00:44:58,737 --> 00:45:00,572
Is she planning on talking to Tae-hoon?

954
00:45:00,656 --> 00:45:02,366
No wonder she wants to clear things up.

955
00:45:02,449 --> 00:45:03,784
Even if they don't get an outside date,

956
00:45:03,867 --> 00:45:05,494
- they should talk.
- They need closure.

957
00:45:05,577 --> 00:45:06,703
- Yeah.
- They do.

958
00:45:07,287 --> 00:45:08,163
Someone's coming.

959
00:45:09,164 --> 00:45:10,040
- Let's talk.
- What's up?

960
00:45:10,124 --> 00:45:11,667
- Okay.
- I see you were asleep.

961
00:45:11,750 --> 00:45:12,918
- You just woke up, right?
- Yeah.

962
00:45:13,544 --> 00:45:14,461
Let's go.

963
00:45:14,545 --> 00:45:15,712
Did you have a nice date?

964
00:45:15,796 --> 00:45:17,923
Yeah, we talked.

965
00:45:18,006 --> 00:45:18,841
Well done.

966
00:45:19,508 --> 00:45:20,843
- Go on.
- You start.

967
00:45:21,844 --> 00:45:22,803
You go first.

968
00:45:24,054 --> 00:45:25,681
I had a date with Seung-hyun.

969
00:45:26,473 --> 00:45:29,852
We had black pork
and took a stroll on the beach.

970
00:45:29,935 --> 00:45:32,020
- Sounds like a nice date.
- Yeah, it was fun.

971
00:45:34,648 --> 00:45:36,108
Have you organized your thoughts?

972
00:45:37,651 --> 00:45:41,155
Yeah. I gave you my answer today.

973
00:45:41,238 --> 00:45:45,033
Honestly, there is someone
who likes you more than I do.

974
00:45:45,117 --> 00:45:46,285
- What?
- Huh?

975
00:45:46,952 --> 00:45:48,203
So you've given up?

976
00:45:48,287 --> 00:45:49,746
It's not that I've given up.

977
00:45:49,830 --> 00:45:52,082
It's just right that you choose him.

978
00:45:52,916 --> 00:45:53,959
That's how I see it.

979
00:45:54,585 --> 00:45:55,752
What is he saying?

980
00:45:57,004 --> 00:45:58,630
Seung-hyun asked me if I minded,

981
00:45:58,714 --> 00:46:01,258
and I told him I didn't mind

982
00:46:01,341 --> 00:46:03,552
because I think he likes you more.

983
00:46:03,635 --> 00:46:05,929
So I told him I'm fine
with whatever happens.

984
00:46:06,430 --> 00:46:07,973
It's right for me to go to him?

985
00:46:11,935 --> 00:46:13,937
I can't offer you as much as he can.

986
00:46:15,898 --> 00:46:19,818
- He's handling it like a coward.
- He is.

987
00:46:19,902 --> 00:46:24,865
It could be better for him just to say,
"I don't like you that much."

988
00:46:29,995 --> 00:46:31,330
Does that clear things up for you?

989
00:46:33,540 --> 00:46:36,210
<i>- She doesn't look satisfied.</i>
<i>- It doesn't sit right with her.</i>

990
00:46:38,670 --> 00:46:39,671
Let's go.

991
00:46:39,755 --> 00:46:41,381
Shall we? That's everything?

992
00:46:41,465 --> 00:46:43,008
- You don't have anything more to say?
- No.

993
00:46:43,675 --> 00:46:44,927
You don't have any more questions?

994
00:46:45,010 --> 00:46:46,512
- No.
- Will you make a final selection?

995
00:46:46,595 --> 00:46:48,096
- Final selection?
- Yes.

996
00:46:49,681 --> 00:46:51,433
I can't tell you.

997
00:46:53,185 --> 00:46:54,937
I feel like you're winding me up.

998
00:46:55,979 --> 00:46:57,356
- Let's go.
- Okay.

999
00:47:01,235 --> 00:47:04,863
I don't know
if I'm just slow on the uptake,

1000
00:47:05,489 --> 00:47:07,991
but I was a bit confused.

1001
00:47:08,575 --> 00:47:10,536
In a way, it feels like a rejection,

1002
00:47:10,619 --> 00:47:12,788
but it also feels like
he was being considerate of me.

1003
00:47:13,372 --> 00:47:18,502
And in a way, it also seems
like he's being considerate of Seung-hyun.

1004
00:47:18,585 --> 00:47:22,089
So I was confused
about how I should take it.

1005
00:47:23,131 --> 00:47:25,509
It didn't feel like he was
being considerate of anyone.

1006
00:47:25,592 --> 00:47:27,594
"You are very attractive,

1007
00:47:27,678 --> 00:47:30,806
but someone who appreciates
your charm more than I do

1008
00:47:30,889 --> 00:47:33,559
is Seung-hyun,
so I think I should step aside."

1009
00:47:33,642 --> 00:47:35,727
- It's so ambiguous.
- That's just

1010
00:47:35,811 --> 00:47:38,063
- him not being honest.
- It's an excuse, right?

1011
00:47:38,146 --> 00:47:40,983
Tae-hoon just doesn't
like Soo-hyun that much.

1012
00:47:41,066 --> 00:47:41,942
That's right.

1013
00:47:42,025 --> 00:47:44,403
In a way, from Tae-hoon's perspective,

1014
00:47:44,486 --> 00:47:47,614
he was rejecting her in his own way.

1015
00:47:47,698 --> 00:47:50,033
But I'm not sure Soo-hyun
will be able to accept it.

1016
00:47:50,117 --> 00:47:51,368
She really liked him.

1017
00:47:51,451 --> 00:47:53,620
- She liked him more.
- Yeah, so it will be harder on her.

1018
00:47:53,704 --> 00:47:55,414
She seems very confused.

1019
00:47:55,497 --> 00:47:57,624
Oh, dear. What will she do?

1020
00:47:59,126 --> 00:48:01,128
Did you have a date? Who was it with?

1021
00:48:01,211 --> 00:48:03,422
- It was with Hyuk-joon.
- Me too.

1022
00:48:03,505 --> 00:48:06,258
- Did you not meet Jung-yun today?
- No, I didn't.

1023
00:48:06,341 --> 00:48:08,260
- Jung-yun didn't pick you?
- He didn't request a date?

1024
00:48:08,343 --> 00:48:09,511
No, he didn't.

1025
00:48:09,595 --> 00:48:13,223
- But I should go talk to him now.
- Oh, me too.

1026
00:48:14,391 --> 00:48:16,852
- What for?
- Is she going to end things?

1027
00:48:16,935 --> 00:48:19,021
She'll tell him once and for all.

1028
00:48:19,646 --> 00:48:20,939
Yeah, so I…

1029
00:48:21,023 --> 00:48:22,774
- Hey, Jung-yun. Let's talk.
- Hello.

1030
00:48:22,858 --> 00:48:25,277
- Jin-woo, can you step out for a bit?
- Can we talk?

1031
00:48:25,360 --> 00:48:26,778
- Okay.
- Sure.

1032
00:48:28,322 --> 00:48:29,531
Did you have<i> ramyeon </i>earlier?

1033
00:48:29,615 --> 00:48:31,116
- Did you eat?
- Yeah, I did.

1034
00:48:31,700 --> 00:48:32,534
Well done.

1035
00:48:34,828 --> 00:48:36,538
Did you go to the Post Office
this morning?

1036
00:48:36,622 --> 00:48:38,457
- Did you check your cabinet?
- Yeah, I did.

1037
00:48:38,540 --> 00:48:40,792
I got you a bracelet.

1038
00:48:40,876 --> 00:48:42,002
Yeah, thanks.

1039
00:48:42,085 --> 00:48:45,255
THIS MORNING

1040
00:48:50,886 --> 00:48:55,849
Yesterday, you asked me
if I'd tell you once I've made up my mind.

1041
00:48:55,932 --> 00:48:56,850
Yeah.

1042
00:48:56,933 --> 00:48:58,935
- And I told you I would.
- Right.

1043
00:49:00,896 --> 00:49:02,022
Well…

1044
00:49:04,107 --> 00:49:06,652
I feel so comfortable around you,

1045
00:49:07,235 --> 00:49:10,989
- and you're the closest to my ideal type.
- Right.

1046
00:49:11,698 --> 00:49:13,950
But to be honest,

1047
00:49:14,034 --> 00:49:19,122
I realized yesterday that my feelings
probably won't turn romantic.

1048
00:49:23,585 --> 00:49:25,420
I feel really thankful,

1049
00:49:25,504 --> 00:49:28,924
and I'm sorry that I can't
reciprocate your feelings.

1050
00:49:30,425 --> 00:49:32,344
But that is…

1051
00:49:34,888 --> 00:49:38,433
Feelings can't always be mutual.

1052
00:49:40,394 --> 00:49:42,646
To be honest, even so…

1053
00:49:43,897 --> 00:49:46,400
I was waiting for you

1054
00:49:46,483 --> 00:49:49,277
to come and talk to me like this.

1055
00:49:50,278 --> 00:49:53,198
I feel like I took too long.

1056
00:49:56,493 --> 00:50:00,163
- Yeah, but the time we have is…
- It's very short.

1057
00:50:00,247 --> 00:50:02,916
I thought it would be nice
to have a bit more time.

1058
00:50:02,999 --> 00:50:05,210
That's why I feel…

1059
00:50:05,794 --> 00:50:09,131
At the end of the day, we did
what we could in the time we were given.

1060
00:50:11,758 --> 00:50:13,343
So, I think it's okay.

1061
00:50:14,094 --> 00:50:16,805
Jung-yun's the one doing the comforting.

1062
00:50:16,888 --> 00:50:19,599
You're a really understanding person.

1063
00:50:23,061 --> 00:50:23,895
But you know…

1064
00:50:27,232 --> 00:50:31,445
I came onto this show thinking

1065
00:50:32,070 --> 00:50:36,450
it would be good to gain
something from this experience.

1066
00:50:36,533 --> 00:50:39,911
- Did you?
- So compared to how I was before--

1067
00:50:39,995 --> 00:50:42,122
- You've grown?
- Yeah, if I've changed at all,

1068
00:50:42,205 --> 00:50:44,374
I think that's a pretty great takeaway.

1069
00:50:44,458 --> 00:50:47,461
Do you feel like
you've changed for the better?

1070
00:50:47,544 --> 00:50:49,045
Yeah, I do.

1071
00:50:49,921 --> 00:50:52,507
I do feel like I've grown a little.

1072
00:50:52,591 --> 00:50:54,801
I'm a little bit different
from how I was before.

1073
00:50:56,303 --> 00:50:58,513
There were things I wanted to try,

1074
00:51:00,015 --> 00:51:01,600
and I went for it.

1075
00:51:02,184 --> 00:51:05,353
I don't want you to feel too awkward

1076
00:51:05,437 --> 00:51:06,605
- or uneasy.
- I don't feel uneasy.

1077
00:51:07,522 --> 00:51:09,357
I want you to take it easy.

1078
00:51:09,441 --> 00:51:11,777
I want you to do whatever suits you too.

1079
00:51:12,611 --> 00:51:14,404
Jung-yun's really matured.

1080
00:51:14,488 --> 00:51:15,572
He's so cool.

1081
00:51:15,655 --> 00:51:20,243
I feel like he really grew from the pain.

1082
00:51:20,827 --> 00:51:23,038
I came here to go with the flow

1083
00:51:23,663 --> 00:51:24,790
and follow my heart.

1084
00:51:24,873 --> 00:51:27,584
- That's why I came on the show.
- That's so admirable.

1085
00:51:28,710 --> 00:51:30,712
- We don't have long left.
- Exactly.

1086
00:51:30,796 --> 00:51:33,632
We should enjoy
the little time we have left.

1087
00:51:33,715 --> 00:51:34,716
Let's enjoy it.

1088
00:51:34,800 --> 00:51:36,051
- Shall we go?
- Okay.

1089
00:51:36,676 --> 00:51:38,637
- Thanks for your time.
- Sure.

1090
00:51:41,139 --> 00:51:42,849
I'm sorry if I took so long.

1091
00:51:42,933 --> 00:51:44,810
No, it's really okay.

1092
00:51:46,186 --> 00:51:47,437
<i>Honestly,</i>

1093
00:51:47,521 --> 00:51:50,148
I kind of expected it.

1094
00:51:50,732 --> 00:51:53,693
The longer she took to think about it…

1095
00:51:55,654 --> 00:51:58,198
the more I saw this coming.

1096
00:51:59,699 --> 00:52:01,576
I would be lying if I said
I wasn't disappointed.

1097
00:52:02,327 --> 00:52:03,662
I am obviously disappointed.

1098
00:52:03,745 --> 00:52:05,747
But even so,

1099
00:52:05,831 --> 00:52:07,666
since being on the show,

1100
00:52:07,749 --> 00:52:10,043
<i>the things I've thought and felt,</i>

1101
00:52:10,126 --> 00:52:12,087
<i>and the things I did</i>

1102
00:52:12,838 --> 00:52:15,507
<i>to turn those things into action…</i>

1103
00:52:15,590 --> 00:52:17,050
He expressed himself as much as he could.

1104
00:52:17,133 --> 00:52:18,176
- He did.
- Yeah.

1105
00:52:19,553 --> 00:52:21,304
<i>I feel</i>

1106
00:52:22,013 --> 00:52:24,558
<i>very proud of myself and satisfied.</i>

1107
00:52:26,309 --> 00:52:28,395
<i>So even though I am disappointed,</i>

1108
00:52:28,478 --> 00:52:30,063
I'm still pleased.

1109
00:52:30,146 --> 00:52:32,232
That's how I'd wrap this up.

1110
00:52:33,233 --> 00:52:35,235
He experienced a lot,

1111
00:52:35,318 --> 00:52:38,029
especially emotionally,
and that's a big deal.

1112
00:52:38,113 --> 00:52:39,823
- He's gained a lot from it.
- He's learned a lot.

1113
00:52:39,906 --> 00:52:43,827
And he really put in a lot of effort.

1114
00:52:43,910 --> 00:52:46,538
He went all out,
starting with his makeover.

1115
00:52:46,621 --> 00:52:48,540
- He went on so many mock blind dates.
- That's right.

1116
00:52:48,623 --> 00:52:50,542
His eyes are

1117
00:52:50,625 --> 00:52:53,003
- very soulful.
- He's so handsome.

1118
00:52:53,086 --> 00:52:54,921
He's got a cool aura.

1119
00:52:55,005 --> 00:52:56,089
- Yeah.
- He does.

1120
00:52:56,172 --> 00:52:57,340
He's one of us.

1121
00:52:58,258 --> 00:52:59,134
Let's just move on.

1122
00:53:09,102 --> 00:53:11,605
During my time on this show,

1123
00:53:11,688 --> 00:53:15,609
it's true that you are the guy
I've felt the most drawn to.

1124
00:53:18,403 --> 00:53:21,156
And in terms of you as a person,

1125
00:53:21,990 --> 00:53:24,618
I thought you were a good catch.

1126
00:53:24,701 --> 00:53:26,870
So even though I did feel
like you were moving a bit fast,

1127
00:53:26,953 --> 00:53:30,707
I wanted to see it through to the end.

1128
00:53:32,417 --> 00:53:35,795
But honestly, there's just one thing
about you that concerned me.

1129
00:53:35,879 --> 00:53:37,631
- The fact that you're a student.
- I see.

1130
00:53:41,593 --> 00:53:45,055
When I imagine going back
to the real world,

1131
00:53:46,681 --> 00:53:49,184
I can already see
that it'll be hard to make things work.

1132
00:53:51,436 --> 00:53:53,647
It makes a bigger difference
than you might think.

1133
00:54:00,528 --> 00:54:03,281
So my mind was made up today.

1134
00:54:07,661 --> 00:54:10,288
But I regret not being more relaxed

1135
00:54:10,372 --> 00:54:13,541
and having more fun with you
these last few days.

1136
00:54:14,125 --> 00:54:17,629
I was just conflicted the whole time,
only to reach this decision.

1137
00:54:17,712 --> 00:54:18,880
So I feel really bad about that.

1138
00:54:18,964 --> 00:54:20,006
No, it's okay.

1139
00:54:24,552 --> 00:54:27,055
I saw this coming,
but to actually hear it…

1140
00:54:28,139 --> 00:54:29,557
- It's hard, isn't it?
- Yeah.

1141
00:54:34,396 --> 00:54:35,647
Thanks for telling me, though.

1142
00:54:38,692 --> 00:54:41,528
I'm sorry you had to choose
such a complicated girl.

1143
00:54:41,611 --> 00:54:42,654
No, it's fine.

1144
00:54:46,950 --> 00:54:47,951
Okay.

1145
00:54:49,869 --> 00:54:50,870
I'll get up first.

1146
00:54:50,954 --> 00:54:52,580
Okay. I'll stay a bit longer.

1147
00:54:52,664 --> 00:54:53,873
Take time to collect yourself.

1148
00:55:07,846 --> 00:55:12,100
<i>Jeong-eun told me that I did my best</i>
<i>and that really helped,</i>

1149
00:55:12,183 --> 00:55:16,187
<i>but she wasn't ready</i>
<i>to reciprocate my feelings.</i>

1150
00:55:17,063 --> 00:55:21,317
I know that she was telling me
not to blame myself,

1151
00:55:21,401 --> 00:55:24,029
but I can't help feeling self-conscious
about being a student,

1152
00:55:24,112 --> 00:55:27,323
and I wonder if things would've been
different if I was more good-looking.

1153
00:55:27,407 --> 00:55:29,492
It's hard not to be hard on myself.

1154
00:55:30,243 --> 00:55:32,162
Jin-woo has a tendency

1155
00:55:32,245 --> 00:55:35,290
- to find fault with himself.
- That's right.

1156
00:55:35,373 --> 00:55:37,333
- So that's a bit worrying.
- It is.

1157
00:55:37,417 --> 00:55:40,253
But once he enters the working world,

1158
00:55:40,336 --> 00:55:42,338
he can naturally shake off
that kind of insecurity.

1159
00:55:42,422 --> 00:55:46,176
But I think Jeong-eun
just wasn't that into him.

1160
00:55:46,259 --> 00:55:47,343
- Yeah.
- That's true too.

1161
00:55:47,427 --> 00:55:48,344
- That's a big part.
- Yeah.

1162
00:55:48,428 --> 00:55:50,263
She has clear standards,

1163
00:55:50,346 --> 00:55:54,934
but she also wasn't into him enough
to let go of those standards.

1164
00:55:55,018 --> 00:55:56,019
- It wasn't enough.
- Exactly.

1165
00:55:56,102 --> 00:55:57,103
You're right.

1166
00:55:57,187 --> 00:55:58,521
- She wasn't that into him.
- Exactly.

1167
00:55:58,605 --> 00:56:00,148
Her feelings weren't that strong.

1168
00:56:01,566 --> 00:56:02,859
I feel so much better.

1169
00:56:03,485 --> 00:56:04,360
Yeah.

1170
00:56:04,444 --> 00:56:05,904
Have you decided to just go for it?

1171
00:56:05,987 --> 00:56:07,155
Are you all in?

1172
00:56:07,238 --> 00:56:08,823
- What do you mean?
- What?

1173
00:56:08,907 --> 00:56:10,492
Didn't the talk go well?

1174
00:56:10,575 --> 00:56:12,786
- Did it not go well?
- Of course. It went fine.

1175
00:56:13,369 --> 00:56:14,621
She rejected me, basically.

1176
00:56:14,704 --> 00:56:16,623
- Really?
- Yeah.

1177
00:56:16,706 --> 00:56:17,874
- Why?
- Spill the beans.

1178
00:56:17,957 --> 00:56:19,042
What do you mean why?

1179
00:56:20,877 --> 00:56:21,920
I just thanked her

1180
00:56:22,629 --> 00:56:23,671
for being honest with me.

1181
00:56:24,756 --> 00:56:26,716
I just got flat-out rejected too.

1182
00:56:26,800 --> 00:56:27,926
- Really?
- Yeah.

1183
00:56:28,968 --> 00:56:30,804
It wasn't a total surprise,

1184
00:56:30,887 --> 00:56:32,889
but I feel a bit glum
now that she's confirmed it.

1185
00:56:33,515 --> 00:56:34,682
I kind of got my hopes up.

1186
00:56:34,766 --> 00:56:38,103
But I had a bad feeling
as soon as we sat down to talk.

1187
00:56:38,186 --> 00:56:39,062
I got the sense

1188
00:56:39,854 --> 00:56:41,106
it would be a rejection.

1189
00:56:43,983 --> 00:56:47,153
And I didn't think
it would matter that I'm a student,

1190
00:56:47,237 --> 00:56:49,155
but she told me that was the reason, so…

1191
00:56:50,281 --> 00:56:51,282
That makes it harder.

1192
00:56:53,743 --> 00:56:57,080
It makes me think that even if
I think something's not a big deal,

1193
00:56:57,705 --> 00:57:00,458
it might not be the case for someone else.

1194
00:57:02,085 --> 00:57:03,253
Whether it's my height or my job.

1195
00:57:04,546 --> 00:57:06,965
I thought being a good person
was all that mattered, but…

1196
00:57:07,799 --> 00:57:10,176
I think she just saw me
as a good person, and that's it.

1197
00:57:10,969 --> 00:57:13,763
- But it's different for everyone.
- Of course.

1198
00:57:13,847 --> 00:57:15,723
- He shouldn't be hard on himself.
- No.

1199
00:57:17,559 --> 00:57:19,853
Anyway, so I was rejected
once and for all.

1200
00:57:21,396 --> 00:57:22,814
Don't cry today.

1201
00:57:25,859 --> 00:57:27,735
Should we all have a drink here today?

1202
00:57:28,736 --> 00:57:29,988
Should I get wasted again?

1203
00:57:31,489 --> 00:57:33,491
I shouldn't have put in so much effort.

1204
00:57:36,536 --> 00:57:37,579
Want me to get you a drink?

1205
00:57:38,955 --> 00:57:40,623
It might be hard right now, but…

1206
00:57:41,666 --> 00:57:42,500
I know.

1207
00:57:43,126 --> 00:57:46,171
We've spent an entire ten days here.

1208
00:57:46,254 --> 00:57:47,172
Yeah.

1209
00:57:47,255 --> 00:57:49,591
Of course, it hurts.

1210
00:57:53,052 --> 00:57:54,721
Time will heal all wounds.

1211
00:57:55,346 --> 00:57:56,639
I took down the good luck fish.

1212
00:57:56,723 --> 00:57:58,558
Didn't you notice it's gone?

1213
00:57:58,641 --> 00:58:01,102
Did you? Why did you take it down?

1214
00:58:01,686 --> 00:58:03,062
<i>It kept reminding me of her.</i>

1215
00:58:04,105 --> 00:58:05,231
<i>Then it's good you took it down.</i>

1216
00:58:07,775 --> 00:58:09,903
Good luck fish, my ass.

1217
00:58:09,986 --> 00:58:11,613
No, I appreciate the gesture.

1218
00:58:14,365 --> 00:58:16,409
It was a gift, after all.
She was being thoughtful.

1219
00:58:16,493 --> 00:58:17,452
Yeah.

1220
00:58:17,535 --> 00:58:18,912
This heartbreak is making me sleepy.

1221
00:58:18,995 --> 00:58:21,706
He's having a hard time
because his feelings were genuine.

1222
00:58:21,789 --> 00:58:23,750
- It's because he went all in.
- Yes.

1223
00:58:36,387 --> 00:58:37,847
<i>Gosh, it's the final day.</i>

1224
00:58:37,931 --> 00:58:39,516
<i>The day of the final selection is here.</i>

1225
00:58:39,599 --> 00:58:41,809
<i>Oh my gosh.</i>

1226
00:58:42,352 --> 00:58:44,562
<i>The final selection process is simple.</i>

1227
00:58:44,646 --> 00:58:47,774
<i>Once you make your selection,</i>
<i>you will wait at the designated spot.</i>

1228
00:58:47,857 --> 00:58:50,693
<i>If the person you picked shows up,</i>
<i>you will be a final couple.</i>

1229
00:58:50,777 --> 00:58:52,904
<i>Eternal singles</i>
<i>who don't have a final pick</i>

1230
00:58:52,987 --> 00:58:55,240
<i>- can choose to opt out.</i>
<i>- That's right.</i>

1231
00:58:55,323 --> 00:58:58,284
<i>I wonder how many final couples we'll get.</i>

1232
00:59:02,497 --> 00:59:05,500
- Who is it?
- It looks like Hyuk-joon.

1233
00:59:11,548 --> 00:59:14,592
<i>I will pick Hyun-seo</i>
<i>for the final selection.</i>

1234
00:59:14,676 --> 00:59:16,177
<i>And to me, the final selection means…</i>

1235
00:59:18,012 --> 00:59:19,931
"Shall we get to know each other
on a deeper level?"

1236
00:59:20,014 --> 00:59:21,724
That's what it means to me.

1237
00:59:21,808 --> 00:59:24,310
So there's no reason for me
not to choose her.

1238
00:59:26,020 --> 00:59:28,606
He said he has no reason
not to choose her!

1239
00:59:28,690 --> 00:59:29,566
HYUK-JOON'S FINAL SELECTION: HYUN-SEO

1240
00:59:41,327 --> 00:59:43,997
<i>Choosing someone means</i>

1241
00:59:44,080 --> 00:59:46,791
<i>taking the relationship a step further.</i>

1242
00:59:46,874 --> 00:59:51,170
And I was a bit anxious
about messing things up.

1243
00:59:51,754 --> 00:59:55,258
So I did go back and forth
on whether to make a final selection.

1244
00:59:55,758 --> 00:59:58,469
Looks like she really felt
the weight of this selection.

1245
01:00:25,455 --> 01:00:30,084
HYUK-JOON, HYUN-SEO
FINAL SELECTION

1246
01:00:32,670 --> 01:00:33,713
They did it!

1247
01:00:34,339 --> 01:00:35,173
Success.

1248
01:00:36,591 --> 01:00:39,010
We got the first couple of Season Two.

1249
01:00:40,011 --> 01:00:41,763
- Hyuk-joon and Hyun-seo.
- Wow.

1250
01:00:43,389 --> 01:00:45,266
- You got here first.
- Yeah.

1251
01:00:49,020 --> 01:00:49,896
What do you think?

1252
01:00:49,979 --> 01:00:52,023
I prepared all this silver grass for you.

1253
01:00:53,232 --> 01:00:55,151
You really went all out.

1254
01:00:56,569 --> 01:01:00,323
<i>Honestly, Hyuk-joon</i>
<i>did cause me a lot of stress,</i>

1255
01:01:00,406 --> 01:01:03,368
<i>and I got annoyed and angry at times.</i>

1256
01:01:03,451 --> 01:01:06,537
But amazingly, whenever we went
on a date and I saw his face,

1257
01:01:07,121 --> 01:01:09,248
I felt happy, and we always had fun.

1258
01:01:10,917 --> 01:01:11,751
Goodness.

1259
01:01:12,377 --> 01:01:13,920
<i>So things like that</i>

1260
01:01:14,003 --> 01:01:17,090
<i>made me think I must like him a lot.</i>

1261
01:01:17,173 --> 01:01:18,925
<i>That's how I feel right now,</i>

1262
01:01:19,008 --> 01:01:21,469
<i>and I want to keep getting to know him.</i>

1263
01:01:26,599 --> 01:01:28,393
Firstly, thanks for coming.

1264
01:01:28,476 --> 01:01:29,894
Of course.

1265
01:01:29,977 --> 01:01:31,771
If you didn't come out today,

1266
01:01:31,854 --> 01:01:34,232
I was going to throw you into the water.

1267
01:01:35,441 --> 01:01:37,443
Just like I planned to do yesterday.

1268
01:01:38,403 --> 01:01:40,363
It's so pretty here.

1269
01:01:42,407 --> 01:01:46,452
I feel like we had
a special connection from the start.

1270
01:01:46,536 --> 01:01:50,039
We got really lucky
since we kept getting matched on dates.

1271
01:01:51,040 --> 01:01:52,834
I decided to call it fate.

1272
01:01:58,965 --> 01:02:01,551
After all that back and forth,
fate brought them together.

1273
01:02:01,634 --> 01:02:03,136
- A tale of fate.
- Seriously.

1274
01:02:03,219 --> 01:02:05,847
The phrase "fated couple"
suits them perfectly.

1275
01:02:05,930 --> 01:02:06,889
- It does.
- Yes.

1276
01:02:06,973 --> 01:02:08,558
It worked out in the end.

1277
01:02:15,732 --> 01:02:16,691
It's Seung-hyun.

1278
01:02:25,783 --> 01:02:29,412
<i>I don't think of the final selection</i>
<i>as a confession of love.</i>

1279
01:02:29,495 --> 01:02:33,708
<i>I think it's just about picking</i>
<i>the person you're most interested in.</i>

1280
01:02:33,791 --> 01:02:35,668
<i>So I plan to pick Soo-hyun.</i>

1281
01:02:36,294 --> 01:02:37,295
<i>- Okay.</i>
<i>- Well done.</i>

1282
01:02:37,378 --> 01:02:38,254
<i>- Good job!</i>
<i>- Let's go!</i>

1283
01:02:38,337 --> 01:02:40,173
- Personally, I'm rooting for them.
- Totally.

1284
01:02:40,757 --> 01:02:41,758
Come on, Soo-hyun.

1285
01:02:41,841 --> 01:02:43,593
Soo-hyun, why don't you give him a chance?

1286
01:02:43,676 --> 01:02:46,012
- Seung-hyun is super nervous right now.
- Yeah.

1287
01:02:46,554 --> 01:02:48,681
If only she could give him a chance.

1288
01:02:52,727 --> 01:02:54,437
<i>Honestly, I don't know.</i>

1289
01:02:54,937 --> 01:02:57,190
I feel like it's an 80-20 split.

1290
01:02:57,273 --> 01:03:00,818
I feel like it was fun talking to him.

1291
01:03:00,902 --> 01:03:04,322
I am curious, and I feel a bit nervous.

1292
01:03:10,077 --> 01:03:11,454
Breathe, Seung-hyun!

1293
01:03:11,537 --> 01:03:12,371
You're doing great.

1294
01:03:12,455 --> 01:03:14,290
- He's not inhaling right now.
- Breathe!

1295
01:03:14,373 --> 01:03:16,292
What is he looking at?

1296
01:03:29,847 --> 01:03:30,807
I have a feeling.

1297
01:03:32,266 --> 01:03:33,518
- She showed up.
- Did she?

1298
01:03:33,601 --> 01:03:35,186
- She did, right?
- Okay.

1299
01:03:43,277 --> 01:03:44,111
Did she show up?

1300
01:03:44,195 --> 01:03:45,738
- What made you ask?
- His eyes flickered.

1301
01:03:45,822 --> 01:03:47,573
- Come on, SH!
- She showed up.

1302
01:03:48,199 --> 01:03:49,367
- She showed up, right?
- Right?

1303
01:03:49,450 --> 01:03:50,910
- She turned up, right?
- Did she show up?

1304
01:04:04,632 --> 01:04:05,591
Gosh.

1305
01:04:06,551 --> 01:04:08,344
- Did she show up?
- I don't think this is the place.

1306
01:04:08,427 --> 01:04:09,804
She's somewhere else.

1307
01:04:09,887 --> 01:04:11,472
Did she pick Tae-hoon, by any chance?

1308
01:04:12,265 --> 01:04:13,599
Don't tell me she did.

1309
01:04:18,479 --> 01:04:21,482
<i>I'm picking Tae-hoon</i>
<i>for the final selection.</i>

1310
01:04:30,658 --> 01:04:32,368
Seriously, no way.

1311
01:04:33,619 --> 01:04:35,121
What? Soo-hyun…

1312
01:04:35,830 --> 01:04:36,831
Hyun…

1313
01:04:37,456 --> 01:04:38,416
This isn't it.

1314
01:04:41,752 --> 01:04:46,173
<i>During my time here,</i>
<i>he's the person who made me</i>

1315
01:04:46,257 --> 01:04:48,801
<i>feel the most excited day to day.</i>

1316
01:04:48,885 --> 01:04:51,470
<i>When else would I feel</i>
<i>butterflies like this?</i>

1317
01:04:54,724 --> 01:04:57,643
- That's understandable.
- She picked the person she likes.

1318
01:04:57,727 --> 01:04:59,020
Because we're watching…

1319
01:04:59,103 --> 01:05:00,313
- It's a shame.
- We're watching from the outside.

1320
01:05:00,396 --> 01:05:01,689
So we have a different perspective.

1321
01:05:01,772 --> 01:05:05,276
But she didn't get to bond
with Seung-hyun that much.

1322
01:05:05,359 --> 01:05:06,527
The strawberry banana smoothie is tasty.

1323
01:05:06,611 --> 01:05:08,279
- It played a big part.
- It did.

1324
01:05:08,362 --> 01:05:10,740
- They're sweet and refreshing.
- And the timing…

1325
01:05:10,823 --> 01:05:13,117
Honestly, I can't get over
how good it tastes either.

1326
01:05:13,200 --> 01:05:15,703
I feel the same way
about the blueberry smoothie.

1327
01:05:15,786 --> 01:05:19,498
I will respect Soo-hyun's decision.

1328
01:05:21,083 --> 01:05:22,668
But why?

1329
01:05:32,053 --> 01:05:35,973
THE FINAL SELECTION HAS ENDED

1330
01:05:38,142 --> 01:05:41,604
Expressing my feelings like that

1331
01:05:41,687 --> 01:05:44,732
is something I've never done before.

1332
01:05:44,815 --> 01:05:49,403
So it was nice to have that experience.

1333
01:05:49,487 --> 01:05:53,824
I'm not really the type to have regrets.

1334
01:05:53,908 --> 01:05:56,577
So I don't think I regret anything.

1335
01:05:56,661 --> 01:05:57,745
I don't feel regretful.

1336
01:05:59,538 --> 01:06:02,667
- He was Season Two's ray of sunshine.
- He was.

1337
01:06:03,960 --> 01:06:05,127
Did he down it?

1338
01:06:06,379 --> 01:06:08,047
- He looks breezy.
- Good for him.

1339
01:06:08,839 --> 01:06:10,341
Well done, Seung-hyun.

1340
01:06:33,197 --> 01:06:37,451
I wonder if she still
has her hopes up while she waits.

1341
01:06:49,380 --> 01:06:52,174
<i>I made a decision in my mind,</i>

1342
01:06:52,842 --> 01:06:56,804
<i>but I think I kept trying to avoid it.</i>

1343
01:06:56,887 --> 01:06:59,015
<i>So I was very torn.</i>

1344
01:07:22,663 --> 01:07:23,539
Oh, dear.

1345
01:07:28,669 --> 01:07:31,714
THE FINAL SELECTION HAS ENDED

1346
01:07:35,384 --> 01:07:36,260
Let's go.

1347
01:07:36,844 --> 01:07:37,678
It's cold.

1348
01:07:39,096 --> 01:07:40,389
So cold.

1349
01:07:41,557 --> 01:07:43,476
<i>I kind of expected it,</i>

1350
01:07:43,559 --> 01:07:46,896
<i>so I didn't feel too upset.</i>

1351
01:07:46,979 --> 01:07:48,773
<i>I feel surprisingly okay</i>

1352
01:07:48,856 --> 01:07:52,735
because I feel like
I did my best at every moment.

1353
01:07:52,818 --> 01:07:56,405
I did everything I wanted,
so I have no regrets.

1354
01:07:58,032 --> 01:08:00,326
Oh, Soo-hyun. I wish you'd given
Seung-hyun a chance.

1355
01:08:00,409 --> 01:08:05,748
I think even Soo-hyun's parents
will feel the same way we do.

1356
01:08:06,332 --> 01:08:07,541
When they see this,

1357
01:08:07,625 --> 01:08:10,586
they'll be like, "Why did you pick him?"

1358
01:08:10,669 --> 01:08:12,088
"Come to your senses!"

1359
01:08:13,005 --> 01:08:14,507
She needs to learn.

1360
01:08:14,590 --> 01:08:15,674
Yeah, she does.

1361
01:08:15,758 --> 01:08:16,842
Oh, dear.

1362
01:08:26,602 --> 01:08:27,645
- It's Han-ju.
- Han-ju.

1363
01:08:27,728 --> 01:08:28,979
Han-ju.

1364
01:08:29,063 --> 01:08:33,317
<i>I'm still not sure</i>
<i>what the final selection means to him.</i>

1365
01:08:34,485 --> 01:08:38,114
I don't know how seriously he'll take it.

1366
01:08:39,115 --> 01:08:41,617
But it seems silly not to select him

1367
01:08:41,700 --> 01:08:43,911
since I am interested.

1368
01:08:43,994 --> 01:08:44,870
Why are her eyes teary?

1369
01:08:44,954 --> 01:08:46,622
Why does it seem like she's been crying?

1370
01:08:48,707 --> 01:08:53,045
<i>Regardless of what meaning it carries,</i>
<i>I thought it was a good way</i>

1371
01:08:53,129 --> 01:08:55,256
<i>of expressing my feelings.</i>

1372
01:08:57,466 --> 01:09:00,928
HAN-JU'S FINAL SELECTION: JIN-WOO

1373
01:09:01,512 --> 01:09:02,555
I'm rooting for them too.

1374
01:09:02,638 --> 01:09:03,931
These two are also… Wait.

1375
01:09:04,014 --> 01:09:05,766
- Come on, Jin-woo.
- Jin-woo.

1376
01:09:05,850 --> 01:09:07,977
- Just once…
- Just talk to her.

1377
01:09:08,060 --> 01:09:08,894
Just, you know…

1378
01:09:08,978 --> 01:09:09,937
Yeah.

1379
01:09:18,445 --> 01:09:21,490
<i>One of the things that mattered</i>
<i>to me the most coming on this show</i>

1380
01:09:21,574 --> 01:09:24,577
<i>was making sure to walk away</i>
<i>without any regrets.</i>

1381
01:09:25,786 --> 01:09:27,538
<i>But I'm still not sure what to do.</i>

1382
01:09:29,832 --> 01:09:31,959
- Han-ju likes everything about you.
- Yes!

1383
01:09:32,042 --> 01:09:34,295
Yeah, and she's a Korean medicine doctor,
just like Jeong-eun.

1384
01:09:34,378 --> 01:09:35,212
Exactly!

1385
01:09:35,296 --> 01:09:37,214
But Han-ju likes you just as you are!

1386
01:09:38,007 --> 01:09:39,008
Can you hear me?

1387
01:09:40,092 --> 01:09:40,926
No, you can't.

1388
01:10:10,331 --> 01:10:13,209
- My hands are sweating.
- Just go on one date after the show.

1389
01:10:13,292 --> 01:10:16,921
Just talk to her.
I'm not saying you should commit.

1390
01:10:17,004 --> 01:10:19,048
Think about
what the final selection means.

1391
01:10:19,131 --> 01:10:21,884
- Just talk to her.
- Think about what it means.

1392
01:10:31,185 --> 01:10:32,978
- Open.
- Please.

1393
01:10:34,563 --> 01:10:35,439
Open it.

1394
01:10:37,107 --> 01:10:37,942
Please.

1395
01:10:45,032 --> 01:10:48,035
<i>I will be heartbroken,</i>

1396
01:10:48,118 --> 01:10:49,662
<i>but I've prepared myself.</i>

1397
01:10:58,295 --> 01:11:00,172
Success!

1398
01:11:00,256 --> 01:11:01,423
See? Look at that!

1399
01:11:01,507 --> 01:11:04,343
- Yes!
- You need to go for the one who likes you.

1400
01:11:04,426 --> 01:11:05,511
That's right.

1401
01:11:06,053 --> 01:11:07,972
- Han-ju was crying happy tears.
- I almost passed out.

1402
01:11:08,055 --> 01:11:09,640
- That's what it was.
- Did she cry?

1403
01:11:09,723 --> 01:11:11,517
- Did she?
- She cried happy tears.

1404
01:11:12,685 --> 01:11:15,187
- I'm so happy for this couple!
- Gosh, Han-ju…

1405
01:11:28,951 --> 01:11:33,706
JIN-WOO, HAN-JU
FINAL SELECTION

1406
01:11:48,095 --> 01:11:49,138
Why did you come?

1407
01:11:49,221 --> 01:11:50,264
Why did I come?

1408
01:11:53,434 --> 01:11:55,185
How could you say that?

1409
01:11:57,771 --> 01:12:02,609
<i>My mind changed a lot</i>
<i>over the last two days.</i>

1410
01:12:03,277 --> 01:12:08,490
<i>Since the beginning,</i>
<i>I'd never ruled Han-ju out.</i>

1411
01:12:08,574 --> 01:12:11,869
<i>She has always been</i>
<i>very forward about her feelings for me,</i>

1412
01:12:11,952 --> 01:12:14,371
<i>so she caught my attention at the start.</i>

1413
01:12:14,997 --> 01:12:17,207
<i>And I think that kept coming to mind,</i>

1414
01:12:17,291 --> 01:12:18,584
<i>so I was tempted to give it a try.</i>

1415
01:12:20,419 --> 01:12:22,546
<i>I was surprised.</i>

1416
01:12:23,672 --> 01:12:24,590
<i>And I was happy.</i>

1417
01:12:25,257 --> 01:12:27,718
<i>I was also very grateful.</i>

1418
01:12:30,054 --> 01:12:32,598
- I'm so happy for her.
- Great job, Han-ju's father-in-law.

1419
01:12:33,223 --> 01:12:34,475
- I'm like his dad.
- You're in-laws now.

1420
01:12:34,558 --> 01:12:35,392
Yeah, we're in-laws.

1421
01:12:35,476 --> 01:12:37,603
He looks like Dex today.

1422
01:12:37,686 --> 01:12:38,937
He looks so handsome today.

1423
01:12:39,021 --> 01:12:40,814
- He looks so suave.
- That's our second couple!

1424
01:12:40,898 --> 01:12:42,358
How great. We have two couples.

1425
01:12:42,441 --> 01:12:44,068
So this is how it ends. My gosh.

1426
01:12:46,111 --> 01:12:47,363
In the same way

1427
01:12:47,988 --> 01:12:50,949
that we requested dates

1428
01:12:51,033 --> 01:12:53,243
for the chance to talk a bit more,

1429
01:12:53,327 --> 01:12:56,205
I chose you for the final selection

1430
01:12:56,830 --> 01:12:57,831
because I'm curious.

1431
01:12:58,457 --> 01:12:59,666
Even after the show,

1432
01:13:00,209 --> 01:13:03,670
I want to keep getting to know you
back in the real world.

1433
01:13:04,338 --> 01:13:07,800
That's the mindset I came here with,
like requesting a date.

1434
01:13:08,759 --> 01:13:11,428
- Yes, go on a date.
- Jin-woo took the initiative this time.

1435
01:13:11,512 --> 01:13:13,430
This is how it starts.

1436
01:13:13,514 --> 01:13:14,390
Very honest.

1437
01:13:14,890 --> 01:13:17,101
- Let's keep getting to know each other.
- Okay.

1438
01:13:30,114 --> 01:13:32,449
<i>I tried to be more open and honest</i>

1439
01:13:32,533 --> 01:13:34,493
<i>so that I didn't waste this chance</i>

1440
01:13:34,576 --> 01:13:37,371
<i>because I felt like</i>
<i>that was my biggest weakness.</i>

1441
01:13:37,454 --> 01:13:40,082
SU-JI
OPTED OUT OF FINAL SELECTION

1442
01:13:42,543 --> 01:13:46,130
<i>I don't have any big regrets.</i>

1443
01:13:46,213 --> 01:13:48,465
JUNG-YUN
OPTED OUT OF THE FINAL SELECTION

1444
01:13:49,049 --> 01:13:53,262
<i>So I decided</i>
<i>not to make a final selection.</i>

1445
01:13:54,847 --> 01:13:58,142
<i>I will not make a final selection.</i>

1446
01:13:58,725 --> 01:14:01,520
<i>I won't be making a final selection.</i>

1447
01:14:01,603 --> 01:14:02,688
JEONG-EUN
OPTED OUT OF THE FINAL SELECTION

1448
01:14:06,191 --> 01:14:08,610
It was such a heartfelt story.

1449
01:14:08,694 --> 01:14:10,821
- Yeah.
- Take Hyun-seo, for example.

1450
01:14:10,904 --> 01:14:11,905
She was all in from the start.

1451
01:14:11,989 --> 01:14:14,366
- And Han-ju was the same.
- It was always Jin-woo for her.

1452
01:14:16,118 --> 01:14:18,871
Hang on. I want to see
which of my pictures they used.

1453
01:14:18,954 --> 01:14:22,458
Mine are all kind of cheeky.

1454
01:14:24,001 --> 01:14:25,502
It's embarrassing to see my own photos.

1455
01:14:27,588 --> 01:14:32,593
<i>If there was alcohol around,</i>
<i>I used to just drink it all.</i>

1456
01:14:32,676 --> 01:14:37,055
<i>But since I know he doesn't</i>
<i>like people who get drunk,</i>

1457
01:14:37,139 --> 01:14:39,600
<i>I think I naturally</i>
<i>held back from drinking.</i>

1458
01:14:41,310 --> 01:14:42,478
That's good.

1459
01:14:43,145 --> 01:14:45,272
Love changed her.

1460
01:14:46,023 --> 01:14:50,068
<i>And I used to think</i>
<i>if you're charming and attractive,</i>

1461
01:14:50,152 --> 01:14:55,032
guys would naturally be drawn to you,

1462
01:14:55,115 --> 01:14:59,286
but now I think
being honest about your feelings

1463
01:14:59,369 --> 01:15:00,704
is what makes someone attractive.

1464
01:15:01,288 --> 01:15:05,292
<i>I think the most obvious change in me</i>
<i>will be a huge boost in confidence.</i>

1465
01:15:05,375 --> 01:15:07,669
Now that I've experienced rejection,

1466
01:15:07,753 --> 01:15:09,755
when it comes to opening up to people,

1467
01:15:09,838 --> 01:15:12,549
I don't think I'll feel
anxious anymore about trying.

1468
01:15:20,307 --> 01:15:21,934
They're not giving us the new releases.

1469
01:15:23,477 --> 01:15:24,770
You've already read mine anyway.

1470
01:15:30,025 --> 01:15:30,901
Oh my gosh.

1471
01:15:30,984 --> 01:15:32,694
I really wanted to see these.

1472
01:15:32,778 --> 01:15:35,239
This is such a precious memory!

1473
01:15:35,948 --> 01:15:37,241
We finally get to look.

1474
01:15:37,324 --> 01:15:39,201
I've already read yours.

1475
01:15:39,284 --> 01:15:40,911
But it must be new to you.

1476
01:15:41,537 --> 01:15:43,205
- I wanted to read it.
- Here. It's a gift.

1477
01:15:43,288 --> 01:15:44,581
It's an honor.

1478
01:15:44,665 --> 01:15:46,208
Thank you.

1479
01:15:49,002 --> 01:15:50,420
You were so cute.

1480
01:15:50,504 --> 01:15:52,631
- Right?
- Yeah, so bright-eyed.

1481
01:15:54,550 --> 01:15:57,219
<i>I appreciate how expressive he's been,</i>

1482
01:15:57,302 --> 01:15:59,763
<i>and he gave me a lot of good memories,</i>

1483
01:15:59,846 --> 01:16:02,140
<i>so I'm grateful to him for that.</i>

1484
01:16:02,224 --> 01:16:03,684
<i>And I want to keep getting to know him.</i>

1485
01:16:04,977 --> 01:16:07,437
<i>I thought it was fate from the start.</i>

1486
01:16:07,521 --> 01:16:11,984
<i>Feeling curious about someone</i>
<i>was a very new feeling for me.</i>

1487
01:16:12,067 --> 01:16:14,111
<i>And it didn't just end there.</i>

1488
01:16:14,194 --> 01:16:17,072
<i>She made me want to keep seeing her again.</i>

1489
01:16:17,155 --> 01:16:19,324
<i>So that's a huge deal to me.</i>

1490
01:16:20,450 --> 01:16:24,329
<i>I would like to consider this</i>
<i>our first day as an official couple.</i>

1491
01:16:26,164 --> 01:16:28,792
We'd better take a close look
at these when we get back.

1492
01:16:28,875 --> 01:16:30,794
Right? It's so fun.

1493
01:16:30,877 --> 01:16:32,212
- Right?
- Yeah.

1494
01:16:36,550 --> 01:16:38,176
I've changed so much.

1495
01:16:38,260 --> 01:16:39,553
Before I joined the show,

1496
01:16:39,636 --> 01:16:41,972
I was a colorless person.

1497
01:16:42,055 --> 01:16:43,849
<i>I didn't feel any big emotions,</i>

1498
01:16:43,932 --> 01:16:46,476
<i>and I was like a robot.</i>

1499
01:16:46,560 --> 01:16:47,978
<i>But since coming on this show,</i>

1500
01:16:48,061 --> 01:16:51,690
<i>I felt so many</i>
<i>different types of emotions.</i>

1501
01:16:51,773 --> 01:16:55,736
<i>So I feel like I can start living life</i>
<i>with a different attitude.</i>

1502
01:16:55,819 --> 01:16:57,362
<i>I've been thinking that a lot.</i>

1503
01:16:57,988 --> 01:17:01,199
<i>I think the big change is</i>
<i>that I now have a more positive mindset.</i>

1504
01:17:01,283 --> 01:17:04,244
<i>The nature of my job</i>
<i>requires looking for flaws</i>

1505
01:17:04,328 --> 01:17:07,039
<i>and running calculations</i>
<i>to identify weaknesses.</i>

1506
01:17:07,122 --> 01:17:09,666
<i>And I was really bad</i>
<i>at taking compliments.</i>

1507
01:17:09,750 --> 01:17:13,545
<i>But I learned that it's okay</i>
<i>to accept compliments sometimes.</i>

1508
01:17:13,629 --> 01:17:17,674
<i>During my time here,</i>
<i>I thought a lot about love and dating</i>

1509
01:17:17,758 --> 01:17:19,384
<i>and reflected on myself a lot.</i>

1510
01:17:19,468 --> 01:17:22,929
<i>So I feel like I've matured a little.</i>

1511
01:17:23,013 --> 01:17:27,059
<i>I was always very self-conscious and</i>
<i>hyper-aware of other people's reactions,</i>

1512
01:17:27,142 --> 01:17:28,560
<i>but I was able to overcome that,</i>

1513
01:17:28,644 --> 01:17:31,146
<i>and I've grown a lot mentally.</i>

1514
01:17:31,229 --> 01:17:34,524
<i>I think I achieved everything I aimed for.</i>

1515
01:17:34,608 --> 01:17:38,820
<i>I've never told someone</i>
<i>I liked them before.</i>

1516
01:17:38,904 --> 01:17:43,075
<i>But now I know</i>
<i>that it's not something to be scared of.</i>

1517
01:17:43,158 --> 01:17:46,244
<i>I was always really good</i>
<i>at hiding my emotions,</i>

1518
01:17:46,328 --> 01:17:49,623
<i>and I found it hard</i>
<i>to express my feelings.</i>

1519
01:17:49,706 --> 01:17:51,833
<i>And I wanted to overcome that.</i>

1520
01:17:51,917 --> 01:17:54,336
<i>This big change in me</i>

1521
01:17:54,419 --> 01:17:56,838
<i>will probably amaze</i>
<i>the people who know me.</i>

1522
01:17:56,922 --> 01:17:58,840
<i>But this is the new me.</i>

1523
01:17:58,924 --> 01:18:00,425
<i>I feel like I've been reborn.</i>

1524
01:18:00,509 --> 01:18:01,802
<i>It was a fascinating experience.</i>

1525
01:18:01,885 --> 01:18:04,054
<i>You don't feel emotions</i>
<i>like this every day.</i>

1526
01:18:04,137 --> 01:18:06,640
<i>But I'm already feeling this way,</i>

1527
01:18:06,723 --> 01:18:09,851
<i>so I found that really amazing</i>
<i>above all else.</i>

1528
01:18:09,935 --> 01:18:12,771
<i>I got to meet such great people,</i>

1529
01:18:12,854 --> 01:18:14,648
<i>so every day was really precious.</i>

1530
01:18:14,731 --> 01:18:16,733
<i>It felt like</i>
<i>a once-in-a-life time experience.</i>

1531
01:18:16,817 --> 01:18:20,612
<i>I really want to stay in touch</i>
<i>with all of them.</i>

1532
01:18:20,696 --> 01:18:24,825
<i>When I look back on this time later,</i>

1533
01:18:24,908 --> 01:18:28,328
<i>I think it will feel like a dream.</i>

1534
01:18:28,412 --> 01:18:30,789
<i>And I kind of look forward</i>

1535
01:18:30,872 --> 01:18:33,875
<i>to the kind of person I will be</i>
<i>after the show.</i>

1536
01:19:52,621 --> 01:19:54,623
Subtitle translation by: Hannah Og Nam
